msgctxt "text"
msgid "规则书中没有写明的情况，请与同桌讨论并达成共识后继续游戏；同一问题反复出现时，记录进下一版判例。"
msgstr "If the rulebook does not cover a situation, discuss it with the table and agree on a ruling before continuing; record recurring questions in the next edition of the rulings."

msgctxt "text"
msgid "规则指引书"
msgstr "Rulebook"

msgctxt "text"
msgid "判例"
msgstr "Rulings"

msgctxt "text"
msgid "输入任意问题，获得规则解答或者指引"
msgstr "Ask anything to get a rule answer or a pointer."

msgctxt "text"
msgid "你的工作就是为你的「调查员」在任务过程中下发「策略」指令，通过经验、直觉和智慧引领他们完成任务。"
msgstr "Your task is to issue \"Strategy\" directives to your \"Investigator\" during missions, guiding them with experience, intuition, and wisdom."

msgctxt "text"
msgid "每一「轮」游戏都伴随与众不同的「环境」卡牌开展，给玩家们带来新的威胁（又或者机遇？）。"
msgstr "Each \"Round\" unfolds under a different \"Environment\" card, bringing players new threats—or perhaps opportunities."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "“阿诺”"
msgstr "\"Arno\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "“斑点鸽”"
msgstr "\"Spotted Pigeon\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "“乌鸦”"
msgstr "\"Crow\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "“约翰”"
msgstr "\"John\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(1)~(2)：随机选择你前、后「调查顺位」的「调查员」，弃置任意(1)张对其布置的「个体机制」。"
msgstr "(1)~(2): Randomly select the \"Investigators\" in the \"Investigation Order\" before and after you, and discard any (1) \"Individual Mechanism\" assigned to them."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(3)~(4)：随机选择你前、后「调查顺位」的「指挥者」，弃置其(1)张手牌。"
msgstr "(3)~(4): Randomly select the \"Commander\" in the \"Investigation Order\" before and after you, and discard (1) of their hand cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(5)~(6)：累积(1)点「运势」。"
msgstr "(5)~(6): Accumulate (1) point of \"Luck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 场上清醒的「调查员」"
msgstr "(N) = \"Investigator\" who is awake on the scene"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 累计的「深潜」点数"
msgstr "(N) = Accumulated \"Deep Dive\" points"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 你已损失的「SAN」+ (1)"
msgstr "(N) = \"SAN\" you have lost + (1)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 你支付的费用"
msgstr "(N) = what you pay"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 清醒「调查员」数量"
msgstr "(N) = number of awake “investigators”"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N) = 掷出的骰子点数"
msgstr "(N) = number of dice rolled"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "(N)由你指定"
msgstr "(N)Designated by you"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查 : 深入》支持2~6名玩家游玩。若是组队对战，同一队伍的各位「指挥者」会共享「情报区」的「情报」卡牌（使用或消耗），共享获得的信息（手牌或「情报」相关），但只能指挥自己的「调查员」、使用自己的手牌。"
msgstr "\"Investigation: In-Depth\" supports 2 to 6 players. If playing in a team, \"Commanders\" of the same team will share the \"Intelligence\" cards (used or consumed) in the \"Intelligence Zone\" and share the information obtained (related to hand cards or \"Intelligence\"), but they can only command their own \"Investigators\" and use their own hand cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》打开的游戏盒与配件"
msgstr "The opened game box and accessories of \"Investigation\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》的卡面把名称、概念和行动分开标记。看到不同的括号与字形时，不要只按日常语义理解；它们对应的是不同的规则入口。"
msgstr "The card surface of \"Investigation\" labels names, concepts and actions separately. When you see different brackets and glyphs, don't just interpret them based on everyday semantics; they correspond to different rule entries."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》盒内的卡牌与骰子配件"
msgstr "Cards and dice accessories in the box of \"Investigation\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》情报卡牌与禁忌真相示例"
msgstr "\"Investigation\" Examples of Intelligence Cards and Forbidden Truths"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》是一款支持 2—6 人游玩的非直接对战美式桌游。FreshLi4 新鲜李四游戏工作室。"
msgstr "\"Investigation Deep\" is an American board game that supports indirect combat for 2-6 players. FreshLi4 Fresh Li Si Game Studio."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》游戏配件与卡牌"
msgstr "\"Investigation\" game accessories and cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "《调查深入》Wiki 资料组织"
msgstr "\"Investigation\" Wiki data organization"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「0」| 深度学习：弃置(1)张手牌，从「策略弃牌区」选取(1)张卡牌，加入手牌，不能选择由你在当前「操作阶段」中打出的卡牌，你累计(1)点「过热」。"
msgstr "\"0\" | Deep Learning: Discard (1) cards from your hand, select (1) cards from the \"Strategy Discard Area\", and add them to your hand. You cannot select cards played by you in the current \"Operation Phase\". You have accumulated (1) \"Overheating\" points."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「0」| 神经网络：你在使用「策略」卡牌时，可以使其消耗 = (0)，你累计(1)点「过热」。"
msgstr "\"0\" | Neural Network: When you use the \"Strategy\" card, you can make it consume = (0), and you accumulate (1) \"Overheating\" points."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「0」| 数据预演：你使用「策略」卡牌时，可以不消耗「情报」卡牌，而是累积(N)点「过热」，(N) = 使用的「策略」卡牌的费用。"
msgstr "\"0\" | Data preview: When you use the \"Strategy\" card, you can accumulate (N) points of \"Overheat\" instead of consuming the \"Intelligence\" card, (N) = the cost of the \"Strategy\" card used."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 过载：本「轮」游戏结束时，指定友方「调查员」消耗(N)点「SAN」, (N) =「过热」点数 ÷ (2)，向上取整；若你选择不指定，或没有可指定的「调查员」，你「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Overload: At the end of this \"round\" game, the designated friendly \"Investigator\" consumes (N) points of \"SAN\", (N) = \"Overheat\" points ÷ (2), rounded up; if you choose not to designate, or there is no \"Investigator\" to designate, you \"go crazy\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 回报：仅(1)次；你调查到【禁忌真相】时，不消耗「SAN」，将【禁忌真相】洗回剩余的「情报卡组」。若你的「SAN」变化，可以重新使用(1)次此技能。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Reward: (1) time only; when you investigate [Forbidden Truth], you will not consume \"SAN\" and shuffle [Forbidden Truth] back to the remaining \"Intelligence Deck\". If your \"SAN\" changes, you can reuse this skill (1) times."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 举一反三：你的每个「操作阶段」使用的第(1)张「策略」卡牌消耗 = (0)；若你执行了调查，额外使你当前「操作阶段」的下一张「策略」卡牌消耗 = (0)。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Draw inferences from one example: The cost of the (1) \"Strategy\" card you use in each \"Operation Phase\" = (0); if you perform an investigation, the cost of the next \"Strategy\" card in your current \"Operation Phase\" will be = (0)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 傀儡：每「轮」游戏开始时；指定(1)位「调查员」对其布置「辅助」卡牌：【傀儡 · 催眠师】；本轮结束后回收该「辅助」卡牌。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Puppet: At the beginning of each \"round\" game; designate (1) \"Investigator\" to place an \"auxiliary\" card on it: [Puppet·Hypnotist]; after the end of this round, the \"auxiliary\" card is recovered."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 蛮横：弃置(N)张手牌；选择对除你以外「调查员」布置的(1)张「个体机制」卡牌，纳入你的手牌；(N) = 该卡牌的消耗；你在当前「操作阶段」使用此卡牌时无消耗。无法选择无法被弃置的卡牌。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Brutal: Discard (N) cards from your hand; choose (1) \"Individual Mechanism\" card assigned to \"Investigator\" other than you, and add it to your hand; (N) = the cost of this card; there is no cost when you use this card in the current \"Operation Phase\". Cards that cannot be discarded cannot be selected."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 任务导向：每「轮」开始时可用；指定(1)位「调查员」；若其调查到【禁忌真相】，你指定(1)位「调查员」，消耗(1)点「SAN」，你减少(1)点「任务负债」；不可连续指定同一队伍的「调查员」。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Mission-oriented: Available at the beginning of each \"round\"; designate (1) \"Investigator\"; if it investigates the [Forbidden Truth], you designate (1) \"Investigator\", which consumes (1) \"SAN\" point, and you reduce (1) \"Task Liability\" point; \"Investigators\" of the same team cannot be designated consecutively."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 虔诚：若你调查的「情报」卡牌数量 > (4)，你调查到【禁忌真相】时消耗的「SAN」- (1)。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Piety: If the number of \"Intel\" cards you investigated is > (4), when you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], the \"SAN\" you spend is reduced by (1)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 食髓知味：弃置总计(12)张「情报」或「策略」卡牌，恢复(1)点「SAN」。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Eat the marrow and know the taste: Discard a total of (12) \"Intelligence\" or \"Strategy\" cards, and recover (1) \"SAN\" point."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 数据验证：弃置任意数量的「情报」卡牌，减少(N)点「过热」，(N) = 被弃置卡牌的费用总和 。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Data verification: Discard any number of \"Intelligence\" cards to reduce (N) points of \"Overheating\", (N) = the total cost of the discarded cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 梭哈：每个「赌」技能掷出奇数之前，可以无限使用。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Stud: Each \"Gamble\" skill can be used unlimitedly until an odd number is rolled."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 行乞：除你以外的「调查员」开始「操作阶段」时；你可以请求其「指挥者」给你(1)张手牌，若其同意，则可以额外抽(2)张手牌。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Begging: When an \"Investigator\" other than you starts the \"Operation Phase\"; you can ask his \"Commander\" to give you (1) hand card. If he agrees, you can draw (2) additional hand cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 演绎法：每当你消耗了(N)张「情报」卡牌，窥探(N)张「情报」卡牌。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Deduction: Whenever you consume (N) \"Intelligence\" cards, spy on (N) \"Intelligence\" cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 鱼死网破：你进行调查时，若受到胁迫效果，每调查(1)张「情报」卡牌，弃置任意「指挥者」(1)张手牌。"
msgstr "\"1\" | A dead end: When you are conducting an investigation, if you receive a coercion effect, for each (1) \"Intelligence\" card you investigate, discard any (1) \"Commander\" card from your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「1」| 致命窥探：你调查到【禁忌真相】也无需公示；其他「指挥者」可以质疑你已经调查到【禁忌真相】；若质疑成功：该「指挥者」抽取你(2)张手牌；若质疑失败：你从该「指挥者」抽取手牌和「情报」卡牌各(1)张；若无人质疑你，在「操作阶段」结束时，将【禁忌真相】洗回「情报卡组」。"
msgstr "\"1\" | Deadly Snooping: You do not need to announce it when you investigate the [Forbidden Truth]; other \"Commanders\" can question that you have investigated the [Forbidden Truth]; if the challenge is successful: the \"Commander\" draws (2) cards from your hand; if the challenge fails: you draw (1) cards from the hand and \"Intelligence\" cards from the \"Commander\"; if no one questions you, at the end of the \"Operation Phase\", shuffle the \"Forbidden Truth\" back to the \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 博学多闻：若你在当前「操作阶段」使用过「情报」卡牌，在你结束「操作阶段」后，从「情报弃牌区」选取(1)张「情报」卡牌，加入你的手牌。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Knowledgeable: If you have used \"Intelligence\" cards in the current \"Operation Phase\", after you end the \"Operation Phase\", select (1) \"Intelligence\" card from the \"Intelligence Drop Zone\" and add it to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 抽丝剥茧：你的「操作阶段」开始时，窥探(N)张「情报」卡牌，(N) = (你当前拥有的「情报」卡牌和手牌数量绝对差值) ÷ 2，向上取整。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Peeling away: At the beginning of your \"Operation Phase\", spy on (N) \"Intelligence\" cards, (N) = (the absolute difference between the number of \"Intelligence\" cards you currently have and the number of cards in your hand) ÷ 2, rounded up."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 赌！！：掷(1)个骰子，如为奇数，窥探(3)张「情报」卡牌并分别对其调整；如为偶数，你在当前「操作阶段」受到胁迫 + (3)。"
msgstr "「2」| Bet! ! : Roll (1) dice, if the number is an odd number, spy on (3) \"Intelligence\" cards and adjust them respectively; if the number is an even number, you are under duress + (3) in the current \"operation phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 极度苦痛：消耗(1)点「SAN」；从「策略卡组」抽(7)张「策略」卡牌，从「情报弃牌区」选取(7)张情报卡牌，加入手牌。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Extreme Pain: Consume (1) \"SAN\" point; draw (7) \"Strategy\" cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\", select (7) Intelligence Cards from the \"Intelligence Discard Zone\", and add them to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 勒索：弃置(2)张手牌；从任意(1)位「指挥者」的手牌抽(1)张牌，纳入你的手牌；你在当前「操作阶段」使用此卡牌时无消耗。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Blackmail: Discard (2) cards from your hand; draw (1) card from the hand of any (1) \"Commander\" and add it to your hand; there is no cost when you use this card in the current \"operation phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 祈祷：若你在当前「操作阶段」进行调查后消耗了「情报」卡牌，你可以额外执行(1)次调查；每次调查的「情报」卡牌数量需要大于上一次。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Prayer: If you consume \"Intelligence\" cards after conducting investigations in the current \"Operation Phase\", you can perform (1) additional investigations; the number of \"Intelligence\" cards in each investigation needs to be greater than the last time."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 全身而退：立即结束你的「操作阶段」，你不进行本「轮」后续操作，累计(1)点「任务负债」；若你累计(3)点「任务负债」，你在「操作阶段」结束后「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Escape: End your \"operation phase\" immediately. You do not perform subsequent operations in this \"round\" and accumulate (1) \"mission debt\" point; if you accumulate (3) \"mission debt\" points, you \"fall into madness\" after the \"operation phase\" ends."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 神秘适应：你调查到【禁忌真相】时，最多只会消耗(1)点「SAN」。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Mysterious Adaptation: When you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], you will only consume (1) \"SAN\" point at most."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 失控：你使用「策略」卡牌时，从「策略卡组」顶部翻出(1)张卡牌，也对该「调查员」使用。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Out of Control: When you use the \"Strategy\" card, dig out (1) card from the top of the \"Strategy Deck\" and use it on the \"Investigator\" as well."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 拾荒：其他「调查员」弃置手牌时，你可以将其中的一半 (向下取整，不小于1) 加入手牌。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Scavenger: When other \"Investigators\" discard their cards, you can add half of them (rounded down, not less than 1) to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 势大力沉：当有【胁迫】被布置时，你可以弃置(N) + (1)张手牌，将该【胁迫】布置给任意(1)位「调查员」；(N) = 使用该【胁迫】时支付的费用。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Powerful: When [Coercion] is deployed, you can discard (N) + (1) cards in your hand and assign this [Coercion] to any (1) \"Investigator\"; (N) = the cost paid when using this [Coercion]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 袖手旁观：仅(1)次；你调查到【禁忌真相】时，可弃置所有手牌和「情报区」的「情报」卡牌，然后将【禁忌真相】洗回剩余的「情报卡组」。若你的「SAN」发生变化，可以重新使用(1)次此技能。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Sit back and watch: Only (1) time; when you investigate [Forbidden Truth], you can discard all the \"Intelligence\" cards in your hand and the \"Intelligence Zone\", and then shuffle [Forbidden Truth] back to the remaining \"Intelligence Card Deck\". If your \"SAN\" changes, you can reuse this skill (1) times."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 选召：每「轮」游戏开始时，指定其他队伍的(1)位「调查员」；若其接受【选召】，你们对彼此使用「策略」卡牌时没有消耗；你可以消耗(1)点「SAN」，使其强制接受【选召】，即使这会使你「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Draft: At the beginning of each \"round\" game, designate (1) \"Investigator\" from other teams; if they accept [Draw], there is no cost when you use \"Strategy\" cards on each other; you can spend (1) points of \"SAN\" to force them to accept [Draw], even if this will make you \"go crazy\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 掩饰：弃置(N)张手牌；交换你和(1)位「调查员」的全部「个体机制」；(N) = 你和其「调查顺位」的差值。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Cover: Discard (N) cards in hand; exchange all \"individual mechanics\" of you and (1) \"investigator\"; (N) = the difference between you and his \"investigation order\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 诱导：每个「操作阶段」一次；弃置(3)张手牌；指定(1)位「调查员」；对其布置「辅助」卡牌：【盲从 · 催眠师】。若你与其「指挥者」手牌数量相同，则视作你已经弃置了(2)张手牌。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Induction: Once in each \"Operation Phase\"; discard (3) cards in hand; designate (1) \"Investigator\"; place \"auxiliary\" card on it: [Blind Obedience·Hypnotist]. If you have the same number of cards in your hand as its \"Commander\", you are deemed to have discarded (2) cards in your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「2」| 专注：你不会因为【禁忌真相】以外的原因被动消耗「SAN」，也不能主动消耗「SAN」。"
msgstr "\"2\" | Concentration: You will not passively consume \"SAN\" for reasons other than [Forbidden Truth], nor can you actively consume \"SAN\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 刁难：每个「操作阶段」一次，当你使用「策略」卡牌，你可以弃置任意(1)位「指挥者」的(1)张手牌。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Difficulty: Once in each \"Operation Phase\", when you use the \"Strategy\" card, you can discard (1) hand cards of any (1) \"Commander\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 恫吓：每个「操作阶段」一次；弃置(N)张手牌；指定(1)位「调查员」；对其布置「辅助」卡牌：【胁迫 · 催眠师】。若你与其「指挥者」手牌数量相同，则视作你已经弃置了(2)张手牌。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Intimidation: Once in each \"operation phase\"; discard (N) cards in hand; designate (1) \"Investigator\"; place \"auxiliary\" card on it: [Intimidation·Hypnotist]. If you have the same number of cards in your hand as its \"Commander\", you are deemed to have discarded (2) cards in your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 赌！：掷(1)个骰子，如为奇数，窥探(3)张「情报」卡牌；如为偶数，弃置(2)张「情报区」的「情报」。"
msgstr "「3」| Bet! : Roll (1) dice. If the number is an odd number, spy on (3) \"Intelligence\" cards; if the number is an even number, discard (2) \"Intelligence\" cards from the \"Intelligence Area\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 负罪：你的友方「调查员」需要消耗「SAN」时，你可以代替其消耗「SAN」。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Guilt: When your friendly \"Investigator\" needs to consume \"SAN\", you can consume \"SAN\" on his behalf."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 过热降频：当你在当前「操作阶段」首次累计到(3)点「过热」或没有执行过操作时可用；调查(3)张「情报」卡牌，减少(1)点「过热」，立即结束当前的「操作阶段」。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Overheating reduction: Available when you accumulate (3) \"Overheating\" points for the first time in the current \"Operation Phase\" or have not performed any operations; investigate (3) \"Intelligence\" cards, reduce (1) \"Overheating\" points, and immediately end the current \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 见微知著：使用【窥探】时额外窥探的(1)张「情报」。"
msgstr "\"3\" | A work of subtle knowledge: (1) extra piece of \"information\" can be spied on when using [Snooping]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 九条命：当你要消耗「SAN」，你可以消耗(3)点运势，使你消耗的「SAN」- (1)。该技能只能使用最多(9)次。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Nine lives: When you want to consume \"SAN\", you can consume (3) luck points, so that the \"SAN\" you consume - (1). This skill can only be used a maximum of (9) times."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 巨人肩膀：你进行调查时，从「策略卡组」抽(1)张「策略」卡牌。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Giant's Shoulders: When you conduct an investigation, draw (1) \"Strategy\" card from the \"Strategy Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 力大砖飞：你可以使用多张「情报」卡牌支付【胁迫】的费用。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Powerful Brick Flying: You can use multiple \"Intelligence\" cards to pay the cost of [Coercion]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 明哲保身：你调查到【禁忌真相】时，可以选择(1)位有足够「SAN」的友方「调查员」，由其代为消耗「SAN」。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Protect yourself wisely: When you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], you can choose (1) a friendly \"Investigator\" with enough \"SAN\" to consume the \"SAN\" on your behalf."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 深度苦痛：消耗(1)点「SAN」；从「策略卡组」抽(5)张「策略」卡牌，从「情报弃牌区」选取(5)张情报卡牌，加入手牌。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Deep Pain: Consume (1) \"SAN\" point; draw (5) \"Strategy\" cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\", select (5) Intelligence Cards from the \"Intelligence Discard Zone\", and add them to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 四海为家：弃置(2)张手牌；你在当前的「操作阶段」无需且不能调查。你最多可以使用(N)次此技能，(N) = 本局游戏参与的「调查员」数量。"
msgstr "\"3\" | A Home Around the World: Discard (2) cards from your hand; you do not need and cannot investigate during the current \"operation phase\". You can use this skill up to (N) times, (N) = the number of \"investigators\" participating in this game."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 随心所欲：每个「操作阶段」使用(N)次，掷(1)个骰子，(N) = 你已经损失的「SAN」+ (1)。根据骰出的点数，使用以下技能："
msgstr "\"3\" | Do whatever you want: use (N) times in each \"operation phase\", roll (1) dice, (N) = \"SAN\" you have lost + (1). Depending on the number of points rolled, use the following skills:"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 虚张声势：你可以盖置打出「情报」卡牌，以支付「策略」卡牌的费用。其他「指挥者」可以质疑你打出的费用不足。若费用足够：收回该「情报」卡牌，「策略」卡牌视作成功打出；若费用不足：弃置该「情报」卡牌，「策略」卡牌收回手牌，你在当前「操作阶段」无法再次使用此技能。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Bluff: You can set up and play the \"Intelligence\" card to pay for the \"Strategy\" card. Other \"Commanders\" can challenge the cost you play for insufficient costs. If the cost is sufficient: the \"Intelligence\" card is withdrawn, and the \"Strategy\" card is deemed to have been played successfully; if the cost is insufficient: the \"Intelligence\" card is discarded, the \"Strategy\" card is withdrawn from the hand, and you cannot use this skill again during the current \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「3」| 有备无患：你的「操作阶段」结束时，选择(1)位「指挥者」，将手牌抽取到与对方一致。"
msgstr "\"3\" | Be Prepared: At the end of your \"Operation Phase\", select (1) \"Commander\" and draw cards from your hand that match the opponent's."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「4」| 超载：你的「操作阶段」结束时，指定(1)位友方「调查员」，消耗(1)点「SAN」；若你选择不指定，或没有可指定的「调查员」，你「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"4\" | Overload: At the end of your \"Operation Phase\", designate (1) friendly \"Investigator\", consuming (1) \"SAN\" point; if you choose not to designate, or there is no \"Investigator\" to designate, you \"go crazy\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「4」| 苦痛： 消耗(1)点「SAN」；从「策略卡组」抽(3)张「策略」卡牌，从「情报弃牌区」选取(3)张情报卡牌，加入手牌。"
msgstr "\"4\" | Pain: Consume (1) \"SAN\" point; draw (3) \"Strategy\" cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\", select (3) Intelligence Cards from the \"Intelligence Discard Zone\", and add them to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「4」| 逃避：弃置(N)张手牌；交换你和(1)位「调查员」的「调查顺位」；(N) = 你和其「调查顺位」的差值。"
msgstr "\"4\" | Escape: Discard (N) cards in hand; exchange the \"investigation order\" between you and (1) \"investigator\"; (N) = the difference between you and his \"investigation order\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「4」| 祖传手艺：你可以自由选择从「情报卡组」的最上或最下，进行正向或反向调查。"
msgstr "\"4\" | Ancestor Craftsmanship: You can freely choose to conduct forward or reverse investigation from the top or bottom of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」分为三个步骤："
msgstr "The \"operation phase\" is divided into three steps:"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」结束后累计(1)点「深潜」"
msgstr "After the \"Operation Phase\" ends, accumulate (1) \"Deep Dive\" point"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」结束时"
msgstr "At the end of the \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」开始、进入与结束时，依照规则执行对应操作"
msgstr "When the \"operation phase\" begins, enters and ends, the corresponding operations are performed according to the rules."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」开始后必须首先进行调查。如果「调查员」因【跳过】或其他效果无需调查，盲从视为未生效。"
msgstr "After the \"operational phase\" begins, an investigation must be conducted first. If the \"Investigator\" does not need to investigate due to [skip] or other effects, blind obedience will be deemed to have not taken effect."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「操作阶段」开始时，「调查员」可以窥探(N)张「情报」卡牌。(N) =「调查员」已损失的「SAN」。"
msgstr "At the beginning of the \"Operation Phase\", the \"Investigator\" can spy on (N) \"Intelligence\" cards. (N) = \"SAN\" lost by \"Investigator\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「策略卡组」的底部"
msgstr "Bottom of \"Strategy Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查」是从「情报卡组」顶部顺序翻看并公示 (1)—(3) 张「情报」卡牌，然后纳入自己的「情报区」。"
msgstr "\"Investigation\" is to read and reveal (1)-(3) \"Intelligence\" cards from the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\" in order, and then add them to your own \"Intelligence Area\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查顺位」"
msgstr "\"Investigation order\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」，消耗(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "\"Investigator\", consumes (1) point of \"SAN\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」不公示其调查到的「情报」卡牌（包括【禁忌真相】），「情报区」的「情报」卡牌面朝下盖置。"
msgstr "The \"Investigator\" does not disclose the \"Intelligence\" cards it investigates (including [Forbidden Truth]), and the \"Intelligence\" cards in the \"Intelligence Zone\" are placed face down."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」的「操作阶段」开始后，必须首先进行调查。若调查员因【跳过】或【异时癖】等效果无需调查，盲从视为未生效。"
msgstr "After the \"Operation Phase\" of the \"Investigator\" begins, you must first conduct an investigation. If the investigator does not need to investigate due to effects such as [Skip] or [Chronomania], blind obedience will be deemed to have not taken effect."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」的「指挥者」需要将手牌弃置到 ≤ (8)张。"
msgstr "The \"Commander\" of \"Investigator\" needs to discard ≤ (8) cards in his hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」的「SAN」 分散到"
msgstr "\"Investigator\"'s \"SAN\" is dispersed to"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」的「SAN」 集中于"
msgstr "\"Investigator\"'s \"SAN\" focuses on"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】会损失「SAN」，「SAN」消耗完的「调查员」会「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" who investigate the \"Forbidden Truth\" will lose \"SAN\", and \"Investigators\" who have exhausted their \"SAN\" will \"go crazy\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】会损失「SAN」；「SAN」消耗完的「调查员」会「陷入疯狂」。自己的队伍需要规避真相，同时诱导其他队伍更早触及它。"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" who investigate the \"Forbidden Truth\" will lose \"SAN\"; \"Investigators\" who have exhausted their \"SAN\" will \"go crazy\". Your own team needs to avoid the truth while inducing other teams to touch it earlier."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时"
msgstr "When the \"Investigator\" investigates the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时，你可以选择使其额外消耗(1)点「SAN」。之后，你立即指定另一队伍的(1)位「调查员」，使其消耗(1)点「SAN」。"
msgstr "When the \"Investigator\" investigates the \"Forbidden Truth\", you can choose to make it consume (1) additional \"SAN\" points. After that, you immediately designate (1) \"Investigator\" of the other team, making it consume (1) \"SAN\" point."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」会因此「恢复清醒」"
msgstr "The \"investigator\" will \"recover\" from this"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」会因此「陷入疯狂」"
msgstr "The \"investigator\" will \"go crazy\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」结束「操作阶段」时"
msgstr "When the \"Investigator\" ends the \"Operation Phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」可以清空自己的「深潜」点数"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" can clear their own \"Deep Dive\" points"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」可以选择消耗哪个「SAN」"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" can choose which \"SAN\" to consume"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」每消耗(2)点费用"
msgstr "\"Investigator\" costs every (2) points consumed"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」若没有以「调查范围」上限的数量进行调查，则调查到【禁忌真相】时，消耗的「SAN」+ (1)。"
msgstr "If the \"Investigator\" does not conduct investigations up to the upper limit of the \"Investigation Scope\", when investigating the \"Forbidden Truth\", the \"SAN\" consumed + (1) will be consumed."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」依照「调查顺位」轮流进行「操作阶段」"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" take turns performing the \"operation phase\" according to the \"investigation order\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「调查员」在当前「操作阶段」可以(0)费用"
msgstr "\"Investigator\" can cost (0) in the current \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「概念词汇」"
msgstr "\"Concept Vocabulary\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「概念词汇」表示《调查深入》的专用概念，例如「SAN」「情报区」和「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "\"Concept Vocabulary\" represents concepts specific to \"Investigation\", such as \"SAN\", \"Intelligence Area\", and \"Descent into Madness\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「个体机制」"
msgstr "\"Individual mechanism\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「公共手牌区」的卡牌"
msgstr "Cards from the \"Public Hand Area\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「恢复清醒」并获得(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "\"Recover\" and gain (1) \"SAN\" point"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「回收」从 Vol.3 开始进入规则语言。早期卡牌若没有标注“回收”但受到其影响，以卡牌 Wiki 中的说明更新版本和当前判例共同判定。"
msgstr "\"Recycling\" entered the rule language starting from Vol.3. If an early card is not marked \"Recycled\" but is affected by it, the updated version of the instructions in the Card Wiki and the current case law will be used to determine it."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「傀儡」需要在另一位「傀儡」"
msgstr "The \"puppet\" needs to be in another \"puppet\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「情报」卡牌，并将其原样放回"
msgstr "\"Information\" card and put it back as it is"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「情报卡组」与「策略卡组」翻转"
msgstr "\"Intelligence Card Deck\" and \"Strategy Card Deck\" flipped"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」具有额外的【禁忌知识】和【疯狂蔓延】技能，如无特殊说明，在「调查员」「陷入疯狂」时立即触发。"
msgstr "The \"Investigator\" who \"falls into madness\" has additional [Forbidden Knowledge] and [Spread of Madness] skills, which are triggered immediately when the \"Investigator\" \"falls into madness\" unless otherwise specified."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」没有「操作阶段」，其调查顺位在所有判定中被自然跳过（如：下一顺位的「调查员」「陷入疯狂」，则针对下一顺位的效果将顺延到下下顺位）。"
msgstr "The \"Investigator\" who \"falls into madness\" has no \"operation phase\", and his investigation order is naturally skipped in all judgments (for example, if the \"Investigator\" in the next order \"falls into madness\", the effect on the next order will be postponed to the next order)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」若通过任意手段恢复「SAN」，其将会「恢复清醒」并拥有恢复点数的「SAN」，没有「SAN」的特殊「调查员」无法用此手段「恢复清醒」。"
msgstr "If an \"Investigator\" who \"falls into madness\" recovers \"SAN\" by any means, he will \"recover from consciousness\" and have \"SAN\" with recovery points. Special \"Investigators\" without \"SAN\" cannot \"recover from consciousness\" by this method."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「指挥者」抽取(4)张初始手牌"
msgstr "\"Commander\" draws (4) initial hand cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「指挥者」可以将手牌"
msgstr "The \"Commander\" can put cards in his hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「指挥者」可以随时质疑另(1)个队伍已经调查到【禁忌真相】；若属实：发起质疑的「指挥者」指定(1)位「调查员」，视作其调查到【禁忌真相】。消耗的「SAN」+ (1)。若不属实：发起质疑的「指挥者」弃置所有的手牌和「情报区」卡牌。"
msgstr "The \"Commander\" can question at any time that another (1) team has investigated the \"Forbidden Truth\"; if it is true: the \"Commander\" who initiated the question designates (1) \"Investigator\", it will be deemed that he has investigated the \"Forbidden Truth\". \"SAN\" consumed + (1). If it is not true: The \"Commander\" who raised the question discards all cards in his hand and the \"Information Area\" card."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「指挥者」确认组队情况，选择「调查员」，随机分配「调查顺位」"
msgstr "\"Commander\" confirms the team formation, selects \"Investigator\", and randomly assigns \"Investigation Order\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「指挥者」需将同一队伍"
msgstr "\"Commander\" needs to combine the same team"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「SAN」归零的「调查员」"
msgstr "\"Investigator\" who resets \"SAN\" to zero"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "「SAN」归零的「调查员」会「陷入疯狂」，翻转其角色牌和指示卡，弃置其身上的个体机制，并在后续判定中跳过其「调查顺位」。疯狂的「调查员」拥有额外的【禁忌知识】和【疯狂蔓延】技能，通常不能成为卡牌或技能的指定对象。"
msgstr "An \"Investigator\" whose \"SAN\" reaches zero will \"go crazy\", flip over its character cards and instruction cards, discard its individual mechanisms, and skip its \"Investigation Order\" in subsequent determinations. The crazy \"Investigator\" has additional [Forbidden Knowledge] and [Crazy Spread] skills, and usually cannot be the designated target of cards or skills."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【初火】、【癫火】结算时会略过仿生人；禁忌真相伤害加深类效果对仿生人依然有效；【献祭】不能以仿生人为指定对象。"
msgstr "[Primary Fire] and [Elepsy Fire] will ignore the androids when settling; the damage aggravation effect of the Forbidden Truth is still valid for the androids; [Sacrifice] cannot target the androids."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【初火】和【癫火】结算时会略过仿生人；禁忌真相伤害加深类效果对仿生人仍然有效；【献祭】不能以仿生人为指定对象。"
msgstr "[First Fire] and [Elepsy Fire] will ignore the androids when settling; the damage amplification effect of the Forbidden Truth is still valid for the androids; [Sacrifice] cannot target the androids."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【初火】如何集中同队的 SAN？"
msgstr "[First Fire] How to gather the SAN of the same team?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【癫火】如何平均分配 SAN？"
msgstr "[Elepsy] How to allocate SAN evenly?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【俄罗斯转轮 · I】可以和【砥砺前行 · I】互动吗？"
msgstr "Can [Russian Wheel · I] interact with [Force Forward · I]?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 催眠师】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread·Hypnotist】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 地痞】"
