msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 欺诈师】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread · Fraudster】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 赏金猎人】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread · Bounty Hunter】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 信徒】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread · Believer】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 研究员】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread·Researcher】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 职业调查员】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread·Professional Investigator】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【疯狂蔓延 · 中之人】"
msgstr "【Crazy Spread · People in the Middle】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【降雨概率】遇到被洗回的【禁忌真相】怎么办？"
msgstr "[Rainfall Probability] What should I do if I encounter the [Forbidden Truth] that has been washed back?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【禁忌真相】被调查，（或基于其他「环境」效果本「轮」结束）"
msgstr "[Forbidden Truth] is investigated, (or this \"round\" ends based on other \"environmental\" effects)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【禁忌知识】"
msgstr "【Taboo knowledge】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【卡牌名称】"
msgstr "[Card name]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【卡牌名称】表示卡牌（包括「调查员」）名称；【禁忌真相】有特殊颜色标识。"
msgstr "[Card Name] indicates the name of the card (including \"Investigator\"); [Forbidden Truth] has a special color mark."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【劳改犯】的「调查员」指示卡名称曾被错误印刷为【老侦探】的名称；实际应以当前 Wiki 中的卡牌资料为准。"
msgstr "The name of the \"Investigator\" instruction card of \"Re-education Prisoner\" was mistakenly printed as the name of \"Old Detective\"; the actual card information in the current Wiki should prevail."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【劳改犯】的调查员指示卡名称被错误印刷为【老侦探】的名称【菲利普 · 钱德勒】（双面皆是），实际应该为【丹泽 · 罗比】。"
msgstr "The name of [Re-education Prisoner]'s Investigator Instruction Card was mistakenly printed as [Old Detective]'s name [Philip Chandler] (on both sides), and it should actually be [Danzai Robby]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【目击者】的疯狂技能【疯狂蔓延 · 目击者】中错误印刷了“紧急真相”，应为“禁忌真相”；【老侦探】的清醒技能【博学多闻】中，加入目标错误写成“手牌”，实际应为加入自己的“情报区”。"
msgstr "[Witness]’s crazy skill [Crazy Spread·Witness] incorrectly printed “Emergency Truth”, which should be “Forbidden Truth”; [Old Detective]’s sobriety skill [Erudition], added the target incorrectly written as “Hand Cards”, but it should actually be added to his own “Intelligence Zone”."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【受控】"
msgstr "【controlled】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【许愿池】为什么不能调用【献祭】或【俄罗斯转轮】？"
msgstr "Why can't [Sacrifice] or [Russian Wheel] be called in [Wish Fountain]?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【异常认知】"
msgstr "【Abnormal cognition】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【应召】"
msgstr "【Response】"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【圆滑】被使用时，同时交换被指定的(2)位「调查员」的全部「个体机制」。"
msgstr "When [Smoothness] is used, all \"Individual Mechanics\" of the designated (2) \"Investigators\" are exchanged at the same time."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "【照亮前路 · I】什么时候可以生效？"
msgstr "【Light the Way Ahead·I】When will it take effect?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "│ └── 辅助卡牌/卡名/"
msgstr "│ └── Auxiliary card/card name/"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "│ ├── 策略卡牌/卡名/"
msgstr "│ ├── Strategy Card/Card Name/"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "│ ├── 调查员/职业名字/"
msgstr "│ ├── Investigator/professional name/"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "│ ├── 环境卡牌/卡名/"
msgstr "│ ├── Environment card/card name/"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "│ ├── 情报卡牌/卡名/"
msgstr "│ ├──Information Card/Card Name/"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "1. 「指挥者」确认组队情况，选择「调查员」，随机分配「调查顺位」。"
msgstr "1. The \"Commander\" confirms the team formation, selects \"Investigator\", and randomly assigns the \"Investigation Order\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "1. 开始阶段：结算需要在阶段开始时触发的「环境」、个体机制和技能，并从「策略卡组」抽取 (1) 张牌。"
msgstr "1. Beginning phase: resolve the \"environment\", individual mechanisms and skills that need to be triggered at the beginning of the phase, and draw (1) cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "1. 页面正文、卡面效果、故事和规则解释：对应 Markdown。"
msgstr "1. Page text, card effects, stories and rule explanations: correspond to Markdown."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "2 位玩家"
msgstr "2 players"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "2—6 人"
msgstr "2-6 people"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "2. 「指挥者」抽取 (4) 张初始「策略」手牌。"
msgstr "2. The \"Commander\" draws (4) initial \"Strategy\" cards from his hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "2. 卡牌名称、职业、费用、数量、版本等筛选字段：类别 CSV。"
msgstr "2. Filter fields such as card name, profession, cost, quantity, version, etc.: Category CSV."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "2. 主要阶段：必须进行一次「调查」，随后可以使用「情报区」卡牌、手牌中的「策略」卡牌、个体机制和「调查员」技能。"
msgstr "2. Main stage: You must conduct an \"Investigation\", and then you can use \"Intelligence Area\" cards, \"Strategy\" cards in your hand, individual mechanisms and \"Investigator\" skills."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "3 位玩家"
msgstr "3 players"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "3. 传统搜索和 AI：由构建脚本读取上述 Markdown，自动生成统一资料索引。"
msgstr "3. Traditional search and AI: The above Markdown is read by the build script and a unified data index is automatically generated."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "3. 结束阶段：结算阶段结束时触发的效果，并将手牌弃置到不超过 (8) 张。"
msgstr "3. Ending phase: resolve the effects triggered at the end of the phase and discard no more than (8) cards from your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "3. 开始一「轮」游戏，触发一张新的「环境」卡牌。"
msgstr "3. Start a \"round\" game and trigger a new \"Environment\" card."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "4 位玩家"
msgstr "4 players"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "4. 「调查员」依照「调查顺位」轮流进行「操作阶段」。"
msgstr "4. \"Investigators\" take turns to conduct the \"operation phase\" according to the \"investigation order\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "4. src/generated/ 与 public/wiki-search/ 是构建产物，不要手工修改。"
msgstr "4. src/generated/ and public/wiki-search/ are build products, do not modify them manually."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "5. 「操作阶段」开始、进入与结束时，执行对应的卡牌和技能效果。"
msgstr "5. At the beginning, entry and end of the \"operation phase\", the corresponding card and skill effects will be executed."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "6 位玩家"
msgstr "6 players"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "6. 【禁忌真相】被调查，或因其他「环境」效果结束本「轮」。"
msgstr "6. [Forbidden Truth] is investigated, or this \"round\" ends due to other \"environmental\" effects."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "7. 结算「SAN」消耗，收回场上所有「情报」卡牌，开始下一「轮」。"
msgstr "7. Calculate the \"SAN\" consumption, take back all \"Information\" cards on the field, and start the next \"round\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "8 个特殊行动，构成所有卡面文本的共同语法。"
msgstr "8 special actions that form the common syntax of all card text."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "8. 仅剩一个队伍的「调查员」保持清醒时，胜负已定。"
msgstr "8. When only one team of \"investigators\" remains awake, the outcome is determined."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "阿诺姆"
msgstr "Arnom"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "艾琳 · 卡特"
msgstr "Erin Carter"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "按卡牌右上角的骰子点数记录每位「调查员」的「SAN」，再依顺位抽取 (4) 张「策略」卡牌。"
msgstr "Record the \"SAN\" of each \"Investigator\" according to the dice number in the upper right corner of the card, and then draw (4) \"Strategy\" cards in order."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "把桌面变成调查现场。"
msgstr "Turn your desktop into an investigation site."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "版本边界"
msgstr "version boundaries"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "包含版本"
msgstr "Contains Version"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "包含版本：Vol.1"
msgstr "Contains version: Vol.1"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "包含版本：Vol.2"
msgstr "Contains version: Vol.2"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "包含版本：Vol.3"
msgstr "Contains version: Vol.3"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "包含版本：Vol.Special"
msgstr "Contains version: Vol.Special"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "保持清醒"
msgstr "stay awake"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "被布置【傀儡 · 催眠师】的「调查员」"
msgstr "\"Investigator\" who was assigned [Puppet·Hypnotist]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "被消耗的「情报」卡牌不会被弃置"
msgstr "Consumed \"Intelligence\" cards will not be discarded"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」调查会在"
msgstr "This “round” survey will be conducted in"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏继续"
msgstr "This \"round\" game continues"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏结束后"
msgstr "After this \"round\" game is over"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏结束后回收"
msgstr "Recycle after the end of this \"round\" game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏结束时"
msgstr "At the end of this \"round\" game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏开始时"
msgstr "When this round game starts"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本「轮」游戏中"
msgstr "In this \"wheel\" game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本操作阶段无需且不能调查。"
msgstr "Investigation is not required and cannot be performed at this stage of the operation."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "本页面根据《规则指引书 - v1.1》整理，并同步展示《调查附录》《FAQ》的核心内容。卡牌构成详见当前《调查深入 · 卡牌统计表》。"
msgstr "This page is organized according to the \"Rule Guide - v1.1\" and simultaneously displays the core content of the \"Investigation Appendix\" and \"FAQ\". For details on the card composition, please refer to the current \"In-depth Investigation·Card Statistics Table\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "必须首先进行调查"
msgstr "An investigation must be done first"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "标准版 2.0 已修复了哪些问题？"
msgstr "What issues have been fixed in Standard Edition 2.0?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "并从「策略卡组」顶部"
msgstr "And from the top of the \"Strategy Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "并回收所有对你布置的【任务负债】"
msgstr "And recover all [task liabilities] assigned to you"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "并私下分别对其调整"
msgstr "and adjust them privately"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可超过「SAN」上限"
msgstr "Cannot exceed the \"SAN\" limit"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可以。俄罗斯转轮必须结算完成，才能使用下一张卡牌。"
msgstr "Can't. The Russian Wheel must be resolved before the next card can be used."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可以。仿生人没有 SAN，因此不能成为消耗队友 SAN 的指定对象，也不能恢复 SAN。"
msgstr "Can't. The android does not have a SAN and therefore cannot be targeted to drain a teammate's SAN, nor can it restore the SAN."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可以。仿生人没有「SAN」，因此不能成为消耗队友「SAN」的指定对象，也不能恢复「SAN」。"
msgstr "Can't. The android does not have \"SAN\", so it cannot be the designated target to consume the \"SAN\" of teammates, nor can it restore the \"SAN\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可以。两位仿生人的过热/过载效果是“消耗队友 (1) 点 SAN”，而仿生人没有 SAN，因此不能成为指定对象，也不能恢复 SAN。"
msgstr "Can't. The overheat/overload effect for both androids is \"Consume (1) SAN point from teammate\", and the androids have no SAN and therefore cannot be targeted and cannot restore SAN."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不可直视神 · I"
msgstr "Do Not Look at God · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不能超过其「SAN」上限"
msgstr "cannot exceed its SAN limit"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不是答案。"
msgstr "Not the answer."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "不消耗「SAN」"
msgstr "Does not consume \"SAN\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "布局 · I"
msgstr "Layout · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "部分早期卡牌沿用了普通字形，但后续版本已经把对应词汇定义为特殊行动。请以本附录的行动列表与卡牌 Wiki 的说明更新版本共同判定。"
msgstr "Some early cards continued to use ordinary glyphs, but later versions have defined the corresponding words as special actions. Please use the action list in this appendix together with the updated version of the Card Wiki instructions."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "操作阶段"
msgstr "Operation stage"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "操作阶段开始后，必须首先进行调查。"
msgstr "Once the operational phase begins, an investigation must first be conducted."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "策略"
msgstr "Strategy"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "策略 · 调查 · 卡牌"
msgstr "Strategy · Investigation · Cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "策略卡组"
msgstr "Strategy deck"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "查看常见机制、调查员与印刷判例。"
msgstr "View common mechanisms, investigators, and printed precedents."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "查询"
msgstr "Query"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "常用问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "沉沦 · I"
msgstr "Fall · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "沉沦 · II"
msgstr "Fall · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "抽同样数量的牌，加入手牌"
msgstr "Draw the same number of cards and add them to your hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "初火"
msgstr "First Flame"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "初火、癫火和禁忌真相对仿生人分别如何处理？"
msgstr "How do first fire, epileptic fire and forbidden truth deal with androids respectively?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "初火、癫火和禁忌真相对仿生人如何处理？"
msgstr "How do first fire, epileptic fire and forbidden truth deal with androids?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "初火只在同一队伍内结算，将所有 SAN 集中到“尽可能少”的调查员；不能超过原有 SAN 上限，也可能让清醒者疯狂或让疯狂者恢复清醒。若队友是【中之人】，则全部集中到【中之人】。例如 SAN 为 3、2、1 时，结果为 3、3、0。出现多种最小变动方案时，由对应指挥者决定。"
msgstr "The first fire is only settled within the same team, and all SANs are concentrated to \"as few as possible\" investigators; the original SAN limit cannot be exceeded, and it may also drive the sane person crazy or make the crazy person regain consciousness. If the teammate is the [person in the middle], then all the teammates will be concentrated in the [person in the middle]. For example, when SAN is 3, 2, 1, the result is 3, 3, 0. When multiple minimum change plans arise, the decision will be made by the corresponding commander."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "初火只在同一队伍内结算，将所有「SAN」集中到尽可能少的「调查员」，不能超过原有「SAN」上限，也可能让清醒者疯狂或让疯狂者恢复清醒。"
msgstr "The first fire is only settled within the same team, and all \"SAN\" are concentrated to as few \"investigators\" as possible. The original \"SAN\" limit cannot be exceeded, and it may also make the sane person go crazy or make the crazy person regain consciousness."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "触发「环境」卡牌"
msgstr "Trigger \"Environment\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "触发可以或必须在「操作阶段」使用的的「个体机制」，如无特殊说明，可以不限数量使用所有布置在当前「调查员」身上的「个体机制」。"
msgstr "Trigger \"individual mechanisms\" that can or must be used in the \"operation phase\". Unless otherwise specified, all \"individual mechanisms\" assigned to the current \"investigator\" can be used in an unlimited number."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "创作背景"
msgstr "Creative background"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "创作故事"
msgstr "Create a story"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "此卡牌被使用或弃置后"
msgstr "After this card is used or discarded"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从(1)个其他队伍的「情报区」"
msgstr "From (1) other team's \"information area\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「策略卡组」抽(2)张牌"
msgstr "Draw (2) cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「策略卡组」顶部抽(1)张牌，加入手牌。"
msgstr "Draw (1) card from the top of the \"Strategy Card Deck\" and add it to your hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「策略卡组」翻(1)张牌"
msgstr "Turn over (1) card from \"Strategy Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「策略弃牌区」选择(2)张卡牌"
msgstr "Select (2) cards from the \"Strategy Drop Zone\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「情报卡组」底部向上"
msgstr "From the bottom of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\" upward"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「情报卡组」顶部，顺序翻看并公示 (1)～(3) 张「情报」卡牌，然后纳入自己的「情报区」。如无特殊描述，每位「调查员」每个「操作阶段」必须、且只能执行一次调查。"
msgstr "From the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\", look through and reveal (1) ~ (3) \"Intelligence\" cards in order, and then add them to your \"Information Zone\". Unless otherwise specified, each \"Investigator\" must and can only conduct one investigation per \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「情报卡组」顶部，顺序翻看并公示(1)~(3)张「情报」卡牌，然后纳入自己的「情报区」。如无特殊描述，每位「调查员」每个「操作阶段」必须、且只能执行一次调查。"
msgstr "From the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\", look through and reveal (1) ~ (3) \"Intelligence\" cards in order, and then add them to your \"Information Zone\". Unless otherwise specified, each \"Investigator\" must and can only conduct one investigation per \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「情报卡组」顶部顺序翻看并公示 (1)—(3) 张「情报」卡牌，然后纳入自己的「情报区」。没有特殊描述时，每位「调查员」每个「操作阶段」必须且只能执行一次调查。"
msgstr "Look through and reveal (1)-(3) \"Intelligence\" cards from the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\" in order, and then add them to your \"Intelligence Zone\". Without special description, each \"investigator\" must and can only conduct one investigation per \"operation stage\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从「情报弃牌区」"
msgstr "From the \"Information discard zone\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从不同角度继续调查。"
msgstr "Continue the investigation from different angles."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从顶部弃置剩「情报卡组」的一半"
msgstr "Discard the remaining half of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\" from the top"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从快速游玩开始，按章节了解完整流程。"
msgstr "Start with a quick play and learn the complete process by chapter."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "从情报卡组顶部翻看并公示 1—3 张。"
msgstr "Look through the top of the intelligence deck and reveal 1-3 cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "打出(N)张手牌"
msgstr "Play (N) cards in hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "打开规范 Markdown 文档"
msgstr "Open a canonical Markdown document"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "打开完整 FAQ →"
msgstr "Open full FAQ →"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "打开完整调查附录 →"
msgstr "Open full survey appendix →"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "待补充"
msgstr "To be added"

msgctxt "fragment"
