msgstr "Danzig Robbie"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当此卡牌被从场上移除"
msgstr "When this card is removed from the field"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当你熟悉了游戏流程，将标注了Vol.2脚标的卡牌加入各个卡组，以获得完整体验。"
msgstr "When you are familiar with the game flow, add cards marked with the Vol. 2 footmark to each deck to get a complete experience."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当其他队伍的所有「调查员」都「陷入疯狂」时，最后保持清醒的队伍及其「指挥者」获得游戏胜利。如果一次操作让所有剩余「调查员」同时疯狂，则最后陷入疯狂的「调查员」所在队伍获胜。"
msgstr "When all the \"investigators\" of other teams \"go crazy\", the last team that remains awake and its \"commander\" wins the game. If one operation makes all remaining \"investigators\" go crazy at the same time, the team of the last \"investigator\" who went crazy wins."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当前「操作阶段」每张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Each \"Intelligence\" card in the current \"Operation Phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当前「操作阶段」无需且不能调查。跳过可以在操作阶段的任意节点生效，并持续到该阶段结束。"
msgstr "The current \"operational phase\" does not require and cannot be investigated. Skipping can take effect at any node in the operation phase and last until the end of the phase."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当前仍未修复的印刷问题是什么？"
msgstr "What printing issues are currently unfixed?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当前数据源包含 20 位调查员、39 种策略、21 种环境、8 种辅助，以及 25 张情报牌（其中包含 1 张【禁忌真相】）。"
msgstr "The current data source contains 20 investigators, 39 strategies, 21 environments, 8 supports, and 25 intelligence cards (including 1 Forbidden Truth)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当前页面整理自共享资料库中的《FAQ》；每张卡牌的具体版本与效果请继续前往卡牌 Wiki 对照。"
msgstr "The current page is compiled from the \"FAQ\" in the shared database; for the specific version and effect of each card, please go to the Card Wiki to check."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "当有「策略」卡牌对其布置或生效时"
msgstr "When a \"Strategy\" card is placed or takes effect on it"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "砥砺前行 · I"
msgstr "Forge Ahead · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "第(N)个调查到【禁忌真相】的"
msgstr "The (N)th person who investigated the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "第一次调查到并消耗完「SAN」后"
msgstr "After investigating and consuming \"SAN\" for the first time"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "癫火"
msgstr "Frenzied Flame"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "癫火只在同一队伍内结算，由高「SAN」调查员向低「SAN」调查员匀 SAN；如果存在多个满足最小变动量的结果，由对应「指挥者」决定。"
msgstr "Epilepsy is only resolved within the same team, and the SAN is distributed from the high \"SAN\" investigator to the low \"SAN\" investigator; if there are multiple results that meet the minimum change amount, the decision will be made by the corresponding \"Commander\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "癫火只在同一队伍内结算。由高 SAN 调查员向低 SAN 调查员匀 SAN，例如 3、0、1 会变成 2、1、1。若存在多个满足最小变动量的结果，由指挥者决定；若当前已经平均（例如 2、3），不能为了交换位置而调整成 3、2。"
msgstr "Epilepsy only resolves within the same team. SAN is evened from high SAN investigators to low SAN investigators, for example, 3,0,1 will become 2,1,1. If there are multiple results that meet the minimum change amount, it is decided by the commander; if it is currently averaged (for example, 2, 3), it cannot be adjusted to 3, 2 in order to exchange positions."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查"
msgstr "Investigation"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查到(2)次【禁忌真相】后结束"
msgstr "Ends after investigating (2) [Forbidden Truths]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查到【禁忌真相】的「调查员」可以对(1)位「调查员」布置(1)张「辅助」卡牌：【任务负债 · 赏金猎人】。"
msgstr "The \"Investigator\" who has investigated the \"Forbidden Truth\" can place (1) \"auxiliary\" card on (1) \"Investigator\": [Mission Liability · Bounty Hunter]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查到【禁忌真相】后不消耗「SAN」"
msgstr "No \"SAN\" will be consumed after investigating the [Forbidden Truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查到【禁忌真相】时"
msgstr "When investigating the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查到禁忌真相后又把它洗回去，降雨概率如何处理？"
msgstr "After investigating the forbidden truth and then washing it back, how to deal with the probability of rainfall?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "调查的「情报」卡牌数量 + (N)，N 取决于胁迫后的数字。所有对同一位「调查员」布置的胁迫，在其最近一次调查中累加；若没有调查，胁迫视为未生效。"
msgstr "The number of \"Intelligence\" cards investigated + (N), N depends on the number after coercion. All coercion placed on the same \"Investigator\" will be accumulated in his latest investigation; if there is no investigation, the coercion will be deemed to have not taken effect."

