msgstr "This effect resolves later than other related effects"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "各位「指挥者」的手牌、场上已布置的「个体机制」均不变。此后，下一「轮」游戏开始。"
msgstr "The cards in each \"Commander's\" hand and the \"individual mechanisms\" deployed on the field remain unchanged. After that, the next \"round\" of the game begins."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "各位「指挥者」需要按「调查员」的「调查顺位」，依次从「策略卡组」抽取(4)张「策略」卡牌纳入手牌。"
msgstr "Each \"Commander\" needs to draw (4) \"Strategy\" cards from the \"Strategy Card Deck\" according to the \"Investigation Order\" of the \"Investigator\" and add them to his hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "工会总有答案"
msgstr "Unions always have the answer"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "关于卡牌的详细介绍，以及众筹版/补充包信息，请参考《调查深入 · 卡牌统计表》。"
msgstr "For a detailed introduction to the cards, as well as crowdfunding version/supplement pack information, please refer to \"In-depth Investigation·Card Statistics Table\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "观测异常：你在自己的「操作阶段」只能补充手牌；所有其他队伍「调查员」的「操作阶段」你都可以进行操作。你的「调查范围」等于该「调查员」在当前「操作阶段」已调查的数量。若操作冲突，由该「调查员」决定先后顺序。"
msgstr "Observation anomaly: You can only replenish your hand cards during your own \"operation phase\"; you can perform operations during the \"operation phase\" of all other team's \"investigators\". Your \"Investigation Scope\" is equal to the number that the \"Investigator\" has investigated in the current \"Operation Phase\". If there is a conflict in operations, the \"investigator\" will decide the order."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "归去来兮：你不会因为消耗「SAN」而「陷入疯狂」。若你调查到【禁忌真相】，恢复(1)点「SAN」。每(2)「轮」游戏，你需要额外增加(1)点「SAN」，否则「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "Come Back: You will not \"go crazy\" by consuming \"SAN\". If you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], recover (1) \"SAN\" point. Every (2) \"rounds\" of the game, you need to add (1) additional \"SAN\" point, otherwise you will \"go crazy\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则是地图，"
msgstr "The rules are maps,"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书"
msgstr "Rulebook"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书概览"
msgstr "Rule Book Overview"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书中没有写明的情况，请和同桌讨论并达成共识后继续游戏。如果同一问题反复出现，反馈给制作团队，纳入后续版本。"
msgstr "If there are situations that are not specified in the rule book, please discuss with your tablemates and reach a consensus before continuing the game. If the same problem occurs repeatedly, feedback it to the production team and include it in subsequent versions."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书中没有写明的情况，请和同桌讨论后达成共识，继续调查。"
msgstr "For situations that are not specified in the rule book, please discuss with your deskmates to reach a consensus and continue the investigation."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书中没有写明的情况，请与同桌讨论并达成共识后继续游戏；同一问题反复出现时，记录进下一版判例。"
msgstr "For situations not specified in the rule book, please discuss with your tablemates and reach a consensus before continuing the game; if the same problem occurs repeatedly, it will be recorded in the next version of the precedent."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则书中没有写明的情况怎么办？"
msgstr "What should I do if there are situations that are not written in the rule book?"

