msgstr "What should I do if it’s not mentioned in the rule book?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "规则指引书没有明确规定的情况，由同桌玩家讨论并达成共识后继续游戏；反复出现的边界情况应记录到「判例」中。"
msgstr "For situations that are not clearly stipulated in the rule guide, players at the same table must discuss and reach a consensus before continuing the game; recurring boundary situations should be recorded in \"judgment\"."

