msgid "机器学习 · 仿生人"
msgstr "Machine Learning · Android"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "机制、调查员、环境与印刷勘误的快速查找页。"
msgstr "Quick find page for Mechanics, Investigators, Environment, and Printing Errata."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "基于投出的点数"
msgstr "Based on points thrown"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "基于掷出的点数"
msgstr "Based on the number of points rolled"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "吉姆 · 伯格"
msgstr "Jim Burger"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "即使你已经玩过很多次《调查 : 深入》，即使我们已经尽力让这份《规则指引书》尽善尽美，有时也会遇到规则指引书中未明确规定的情况。请不要过于纠结，和大家商量达成共识后继续游戏。"
msgstr "Even if you have played Investigation: In-depth many times, and even if we have tried our best to make this Rules Guide as perfect as possible, sometimes you will encounter situations that are not clearly stated in the Rules Guide. Please don't get too entangled and continue the game after discussing with everyone and reaching a consensus."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "集中放置、共享使用"
msgstr "Centralized placement and shared use"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "记录「SAN」与抽取初始手牌"
msgstr "Record \"SAN\" and draw initial hand cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "加入各自的手牌"
msgstr "Add to each hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "加入你的「情报区」"
msgstr "Add to your \"Intelligence Zone\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "加入你的手牌"
msgstr "Add to your hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "简 · 艾德勒"
msgstr "Jane Adler"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将(1)个骰子以「SAN」上限的点数朝上，放到该处，用以记录该「调查员」的当前「SAN」。多余的骰子可以放置到一边待用。"
msgstr "Place (1) die with the upper limit of \"SAN\" facing up there to record the current \"SAN\" of the \"Investigator\". Extra dice can be set aside for later use."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将(1)张「辅助」卡牌：【胁迫 · 猛男】布置给你自己；若有任意「调查员」【陷入疯狂】，再次布置(1)张【胁迫 · 猛男】给你自己。若你恢复「清醒」，回收所有由你的技能打出的「辅助」卡牌。"
msgstr "Arrange (1) \"Support\" card: [Coercion·Macho Man] to yourself; if any \"Investigator\" [Falls into Madness], assign (1) [Coercion·Macho Man] to yourself again. If you regain consciousness, recover all \"auxiliary\" cards played by your skills."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将(2)张「辅助」卡牌：【傀儡 · 催眠师】布置给任意(2)位「调查员」；若其中任意(1)位「陷入疯狂」，回收场上的【傀儡 · 催眠师】并重新使用此技能。若你恢复「清醒」，立即回收所有【傀儡 · 催眠师】。"
msgstr "Arrange (2) \"auxiliary\" cards: [Puppet·Hypnotist] to any (2) \"Investigators\"; if any (1) of them \"falls into madness\", recover [Puppet·Hypnotist] on the field and use this skill again. If you regain consciousness, immediately recycle all [Puppet·Hypnotist]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「策略」、「情报」、「环境」、「辅助」卡牌各自洗切整理成一堆，分别组成(4)组卡组。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Strategy\", \"Intelligence\", \"Environment\", and \"Support\" cards into piles to form (4) decks."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「策略」「情报」「环境」「辅助」卡牌分别洗切，组成四组卡组。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Strategy\", \"Intelligence\", \"Environment\" and \"Support\" cards respectively to form four decks."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「策略」卡牌各自洗切整理成一堆。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Strategy\" cards into a pile."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「辅助」卡牌：【禁忌仪式】"
msgstr "Change the \"auxiliary\" card: [Forbidden Ritual]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「辅助」卡牌各自洗切整理成一堆。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Auxiliary\" cards into a pile."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「环境」卡牌各自洗切整理成一堆。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Environment\" cards and sort them into piles."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将「情报」卡牌各自洗切整理成一堆。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Intelligence\" cards and sort them into a pile."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将【禁忌真相】洗回"
msgstr "Restore [Forbidden Truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将【禁忌真相】洗入"
msgstr "Wash the [Forbidden Truth] into"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将本「轮」游戏的【禁忌真相】"
msgstr "The [Forbidden Truth] of this \"Run\" game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将场上所有已布置的「个体机制」"
msgstr "All deployed \"individual mechanisms\" on the field"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将此卡牌回收"
msgstr "Recycle this card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将调查员顺位、情报区与四类卡组拉开距离。桌面布局不是装饰，它让“谁能看见什么”变得清楚。"
msgstr "Distance the order of investigators, intelligence areas, and four types of decks. Desktop layout is not decoration, it makes it clear who can see what."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌放回对应「卡组」的最上、最下或其原位。若对象来自「弃牌区」，可以放回所属卡组或弃牌区的最上、最下，或其在弃牌区中的原位。"
msgstr "Place the card back to the top, bottom or its original position of the corresponding \"deck\". If the object comes from the \"drop zone\", it can be placed back to the top or bottom of its deck or drop zone, or its original position in the drop zone."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌放回对应卡组或弃牌区的顶部、底部或原位。若对象来自弃牌区，也可以放回所属卡组或弃牌区的指定位置。"
msgstr "Return the card to the top, bottom, or original position of the corresponding deck or discard pile. If the object comes from the discard pile, it can also be put back into the designated position in the deck or discard pile."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌放回卡组或弃牌区的顶部、底部或原位。"
msgstr "Return the card to the top, bottom, or original position of the deck or discard pile."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌移回上一个所在位置；若无说明，洗切该位置。"
msgstr "Move the card back to its previous position; if there is no instructions, shuffle the position."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌移至其上一个所在位置；没有特殊说明时，对上一个位置的卡牌进行洗切。由技能直接触发的「辅助」卡牌，其上一个所在位置为「辅助卡组」而不是手牌。"
msgstr "Move the card to its previous position; shuffle the cards in the previous position unless otherwise specified. For \"auxiliary\" cards that are directly triggered by skills, their previous location is the \"auxiliary deck\" instead of the hand card."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将卡牌移至其上一个所在位置；如无特殊说明，应当对上一个所在位置的卡牌进行洗切。由技能直接触发的「辅助」卡牌，其上一个所在位置为「辅助卡组」而非手牌。"
msgstr "Move the card to its previous position; unless otherwise specified, the card in the previous position should be shuffled. For \"auxiliary\" cards that are directly triggered by skills, their last location is the \"auxiliary deck\" instead of the hand card."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将其洗回「策略卡组」"
msgstr "Shuffle it back into the \"strategy deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将其洗回「情报卡组」"
msgstr "Shuffle it back into the \"Intelligence Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将其洗回剩余的「情报卡组」"
msgstr "Shuffle it back into the remaining \"Intelligence Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将所有「顺位指示卡」翻面"
msgstr "Turn over all \"Order Instruction Cards\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "降雨概率"
msgstr "Chance of Rain"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "交换你与另一位「指挥者」的手牌"
msgstr "Swap your hands with another \"Commander\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "交换任意(2)位「调查员」的"
msgstr "Exchange any (2) \"Investigators\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "角色故事"
msgstr "character story"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "杰克 · 纳皮尔"
msgstr "Jack Napier"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "结束「操作阶段」"
msgstr "End of \"Operation Phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "结束一「轮」游戏"
msgstr "Ending a \"round\" game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "结算「SAN」消耗，收回场上所有「情报」卡牌，开始下一「轮」游戏。回到步骤3。"
msgstr "Calculate the \"SAN\" consumption, take back all \"Information\" cards on the field, and start the next \"round\" game. Go back to step 3."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "仅(1)次，其他「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时，你可以使其不消耗「SAN」，该「轮」游戏正常结束。若你「恢复清醒」并重新「陷入疯狂」，可以重新使用此技能。"
msgstr "Only (1) time, when other \"Investigators\" investigate the \"Forbidden Truth\", you can make it without consuming \"SAN\", and the game ends normally in this \"round\". If you \"recover\" and \"go mad\" again, you can use this skill again."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "仅剩(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "Only (1) point \"SAN\" left"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "仅剩一个队伍「调查员」存活，胜负已定。"
msgstr "Only one team, \"Investigators,\" is left alive, and the outcome is decided."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "谨慎追寻真相。"
msgstr "Carefully pursue the truth."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "进入「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Entering the \"operational phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "进行调整"
msgstr "make adjustments"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "禁忌仪式"
msgstr "Forbidden Ritual"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "禁忌仪式 · I"
msgstr "Forbidden Ritual · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "禁忌真相"
msgstr "Forbidden Truth"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "拒绝调查的「调查员」受到胁迫 + (4)"
msgstr "\"Investigators\" who refuse to investigate are intimidated + (4)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "决定调查的「情报」卡牌的数量"
msgstr "Determines the number of \"Intelligence\" cards to investigate"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡面中的特殊行动使用固定含义。若某张卡牌没有额外说明，就按以下定义处理。"
msgstr "Special actions on the card face have fixed meanings. If a card does not have additional instructions, it will be treated according to the following definition."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌 Wiki"
msgstr "Card Wiki"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌 Wiki →"
msgstr "Card Wiki →"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌类别筛选"
msgstr "Filter by card category"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌索引 / CARD WIKI"
msgstr "Card Index / CARD WIKI"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌统计"
msgstr "Card Statistics"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌效果"
msgstr "Effect Text"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌印刷与规则文本冲突时怎么办？"
msgstr "What should I do if card printing conflicts with rule text?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "开始「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Start the \"operational phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "开始一「轮」游戏，触发一张新的「环境」卡牌"
msgstr "Start a \"round\" game and trigger a new \"environment\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "可以对「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」使用"
msgstr "Can be used on \"Investigators\" who \"went crazy\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "可以使该卡牌无效，并直接弃置"
msgstr "The card can be invalidated and discarded directly"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "可以使用多张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Multiple \"Intelligence\" cards can be used"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "快速游玩"
msgstr "Quick play"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "快速游玩流程"
msgstr "Quick play process"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "快速游玩流程指南。"
msgstr "Quick playthrough guide."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探"
msgstr "Pry"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探 · I"
msgstr "Pry · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探 · II"
msgstr "Pry · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探 · III"
msgstr "Pry · III"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探 · IV"
msgstr "Pry · IV"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探：私下（队内）顺序查看(N)张"
msgstr "Spying: View (N) pictures in order privately (within the team)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探(3)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Spy on (3) \"Intelligence\" cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探(N)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Spy on (N) \"Intelligence\" cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探的「情报」卡牌数量累加"
msgstr "The number of spied \"Intelligence\" cards accumulates"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探的信息由所有「指挥者」共享"
msgstr "The snooped information is shared by all \"commanders\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "窥探第(N)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Spy on the (N)th \"Intelligence\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "傀儡 · 催眠师"
msgstr "Puppet · Hypnotist"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "傀儡 · I"
msgstr "Puppet · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "来生"
msgstr "Afterlife"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型"
msgstr "Type"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型：策略：个体机制"
msgstr "Type: Strategy: Individual Mechanics"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型：个体机制"
msgstr "Type: individual mechanism"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型：环境"
msgstr "Type: environment"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型：即时行动"
msgstr "Type: Instant action"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "类型：情报"
msgstr "Type: Intelligence"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "理智压力"
msgstr "intellectual pressure"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "立即调查同样数量的「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Immediately investigate the same number of \"Intelligence\" cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "立即激活「辅助」卡牌:【命定之人 · 赌徒】这一额外「环境」；若你恢复「清醒」，立即回收【命定之人 · 赌徒】。"
msgstr "Immediately activate the \"auxiliary\" card: [The Destined Man·Gambler] as an additional \"environment\"; if you regain your \"awake\", immediately recycle the [Destined Man·The Gambler]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "立刻进行调查"
msgstr "Investigate immediately"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "例如：调查到禁忌真相后会发生什么？"
msgstr "For example: What happens when you investigate a forbidden truth?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "临时「SAN」不影响技能触发"
msgstr "Temporary \"SAN\" does not affect skill triggering"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "浏览全部卡牌 →"
msgstr "View all cards →"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "轮流进行「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Take turns in the \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "罗利 · 西泽"
msgstr "Raleigh Caesar"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "埋葬过去 · I"
msgstr "Bury the Past · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "蛮横无理"
msgstr "Brutality"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盲从"
msgstr "Conform"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盲从 · 催眠师"
msgstr "Conform · Hypnotist"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盲从 · I"
msgstr "Conform · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盲从：「操作阶段」开始后"
msgstr "Blind obedience: after the \"operation phase\" begins"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盲从：进入「操作阶段」后"
msgstr "Blind obedience: After entering the \"operation stage\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "没有打出「策略」卡牌"
msgstr "No \"Strategy\" card was played"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "没有特殊描述时，窥探从哪里开始？"
msgstr "Where does the snooping begin when there is no special description?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "没有直接命中，正在转交规则问答。"
msgstr "No direct hits, rules Q&A being forwarded."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每「轮」游戏开始前，从「环境卡组」顶部抽取(1)张「环境」卡牌，该卡牌卡面效果在本「轮」内会对所有「调查员」持续生效。若本「轮」并非第一「轮」游戏，这张新的「环境」卡牌会代替上一轮的「环境」卡牌生效（上一「轮」的「环境」卡牌不洗回「环境卡组」）。"
msgstr "Before the start of each \"round\" game, draw (1) \"Environment\" card from the top of the \"Environment Card Deck\". The card's card effect will continue to take effect on all \"Investigators\" during this \"round\". If this \"round\" is not the first \"round\" of the game, this new \"environment\" card will take effect instead of the \"environment\" card of the previous round (the \"environment\" card of the previous \"round\" will not be shuffled back into the \"environment deck\")."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每「轮」游戏开始时，由你决定本轮触发的「环境」卡牌，你可以从未触发或已触发的「环境」卡牌中选择，但不能连续选择同一张「环境」卡牌。"
msgstr "At the beginning of each \"round\" game, you decide which \"environment\" card is triggered in this round. You can choose from untriggered or triggered \"environment\" cards, but you cannot select the same \"environment\" card continuously."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每「轮」游戏开始时，指定其他队伍的(1)位「调查员」；你们对彼此使用「策略」卡牌时没有消耗；若该「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】，你「恢复清醒」并获得(2)点「SAN」；该「调查员」可以消耗(1)点「SAN」，强制拒绝【应召】。"
msgstr "At the beginning of each \"round\" of the game, designate (1) \"Investigator\" from other teams; there is no cost when you use \"Strategy\" cards against each other; if the \"Investigator\" investigates the \"Forbidden Truth\", you \"recover\" and gain (2) \"SAN\" points; the \"Investigator\" can consume (1) \"SAN\" point to forcefully refuse the \"Call\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每「轮」游戏由上一「轮」调查到【禁忌真相】的「调查员」先执行「操作阶段」。如果这是第一「轮」游戏，第(1)顺位的「调查员」先执行「操作阶段」。"
msgstr "In each \"round\" of the game, the \"investigator\" who investigated the \"Forbidden Truth\" in the previous \"round\" first performs the \"operation phase\". If this is the first \"round\" of the game, the (1st) \"Investigator\" performs the \"Operation Phase\" first."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每次调查(1)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Each investigation (1) \"Intelligence\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每次经过你的「调查顺位」时，掷(1)个骰子。若为奇数：弃置你前、后顺位「指挥者」的(1)张手牌；若为偶数：弃置你对前、后顺位的「调查员」布置的随机(1)张「个体机制」。"
msgstr "Each time you pass your \"Investigation Order,\" roll (1) die. If it is an odd number: Discard (1) card from your hand of the \"Commander\" in the front and rear order; if it is an even number: Discard (1) random \"Individual Mechanism\" you assigned to the \"Investigator\" in the front and rear order."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每次任务中，你都需要应对不同的异常「环境」，你将会揭示其中的【禁忌真相】所在。「情报」虽然是多多益善，但调查到【禁忌真相】却十分危险，频繁调查到【禁忌真相】的「调查员」往往都会「陷入疯狂」。"
msgstr "In each mission, you need to deal with different abnormal \"environments\", and you will reveal the \"forbidden truth\" within them. Although the more \"intelligence\" the better, investigating \"forbidden truths\" is very dangerous. \"Investigators\" who frequently investigate \"forbidden truths\" often \"go crazy.\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每放入(N)张"
msgstr "Every time (N) pieces are put in"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每个「操作阶段」开始时"
msgstr "At the beginning of each \"operational phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每个「操作阶段」只能使用一个「赌」技能。"
msgstr "Only one \"Gamble\" skill can be used in each \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每经过(N)个「操作阶段」"
msgstr "After each (N) \"operation stage\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每局游戏开始后，将以多「轮」游戏进行推进。"
msgstr "After each game starts, there will be multiple \"rounds\" of games."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每位「调查员」的"
msgstr "Each \"investigator\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每位「调查员」的「操作阶段」结束时，其「指挥者」需要弃置(2)张手牌，否则该「调查员」消耗(1)点「SAN」。若其「指挥者」剩余手牌不足(2)张，无需弃置。"
msgstr "At the end of the \"Operation Phase\" of each \"Investigator\", its \"Commander\" needs to discard (2) cards in his hand, otherwise the \"Investigator\" will consume (1) \"SAN\" point. If there are less than (2) cards left in his \"Commander\" hand, there is no need to discard them."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每位「指挥者」从候选「调查员」中选取需要指挥的角色，并随机分配「调查顺位」。"
msgstr "Each \"Commander\" selects the role to be commanded from the candidate \"Investigators\" and randomly assigns the \"Investigation Order\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每位玩家扮演一位「指挥者」，通过「策略」指令引领自己的「调查员」。每一「轮」游戏都会出现新的「环境」，玩家需要从「情报卡组」中调查并了解【禁忌真相】的位置。"
msgstr "Each player plays a \"commander\" and leads his \"investigators\" through \"strategic\" instructions. A new \"environment\" will appear in each \"round\" of the game, and players need to investigate and understand the location of the \"Forbidden Truth\" from the \"Intelligence Card Group\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一「轮」包含不限数量的「操作阶段」。任意「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时，本「轮」结束，按照效果减少该「调查员」的「SAN」，并将场上的「情报」卡牌收回、洗切成新的「情报卡组」。"
msgstr "Each \"round\" contains an unlimited number of \"operational phases\". When any \"Investigator\" investigates [Forbidden Truth], this \"round\" ends, the \"Investigator\"'s \"SAN\" is reduced according to the effect, and the \"Intelligence\" cards on the field are taken back and shuffled into a new \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一「轮」游戏包含不限数量的「操作阶段」，每位「指挥者」指挥对应「调查员」在其「操作阶段」内行动。"
msgstr "Each \"round\" of the game contains an unlimited number of \"operation phases\", and each \"commander\" directs the corresponding \"investigator\" to act within its \"operation phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一「轮」游戏包含不限数量的「操作阶段」，每位「指挥者」指挥对应「调查员」在其「操作阶段」内行动。「操作阶段」分为以下3个步骤："
msgstr "Each \"round\" of the game contains an unlimited number of \"operation phases\", and each \"commander\" directs the corresponding \"investigator\" to act within its \"operation phase\". The \"operation phase\" is divided into the following 3 steps:"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一「轮」游戏开始前，从「环境卡组」顶部抽取一张「环境」卡牌，本「轮」持续生效。第一「轮」由第 (1) 顺位的「调查员」开始；之后由上一「轮」调查到【禁忌真相】的「调查员」开始。"
msgstr "Before the start of each \"round\" game, draw an \"Environment\" card from the top of the \"Environment Card Deck\", and this \"round\" will continue to take effect. The first \"round\" starts with the \"Investigator\" in order (1); thereafter, the \"Investigator\" who investigated the \"Forbidden Truth\" in the previous \"Round\" starts."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一次真相命中，压力都会留下痕迹。"
msgstr "Every time truth hits, the pressure leaves its mark."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每一轮，真相都更近一点。"
msgstr "Every round, the truth gets a little closer."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每张卡牌的文件夹名是稳定的人类可读路径；调查员姓名中的中点 · 统一替换为连字符 -。index.csv 是总索引，类别 CSV 继续保留原始字段，并追加 Wiki相对目录。"
msgstr "Each card's folder name is a stable human-readable path; the midpoint · in the investigator's name is uniformly replaced with a hyphen -. index.csv is the total index, the category CSV continues to retain the original fields, and appends the Wiki relative directory."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "明辨过往， 未雨绸缪。"
msgstr "Be aware of the past and prepare for the future."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "明示放入「公共手牌区」"
msgstr "Expressly put into the \"public hand area\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "命定之人"
msgstr "The Chosen One"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "命定之人 · 赌徒"
msgstr "The Chosen One · Gambler"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "默认从「情报卡组」顶部向下执行；“正向窥探”也指从顶部向下。"
msgstr "By default, execution starts from the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\"; \"forward snooping\" also refers to starting from the top."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "默认从情报卡组顶部向下执行；“正向窥探”也指从顶部向下。"
msgstr "By default, execution starts from the top of the intelligence deck; \"forward snooping\" also refers to starting from the top."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "默认从情报卡组顶部向下执行；「正向窥探」也指从顶部向下。"
msgstr "By default, execution starts from the top of the intelligence deck; \"forward snooping\" also refers to starting from the top."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "目录约定"
msgstr "Directory convention"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "内化 · I"
msgstr "Internalize · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "内容来源优先级"
msgstr "Content source priority"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你「陷入疯狂」"
msgstr "You \"go crazy\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你「陷入疯狂」后无需弃置对你布置的「个体机制」，你也能正常进行「操作阶段」。"
msgstr "After you \"fall into madness\", you don't need to abandon the \"individual mechanism\" assigned to you, and you can also proceed with the \"operation phase\" normally."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你被视作调查到了【禁忌真相】"
msgstr "You are deemed to have investigated the [Forbidden Truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你不能恢复或主动消耗「SAN」；当被迫消耗(1)点「SAN」时，累计(2)点「过热」。"
msgstr "You cannot recover or actively consume \"SAN\"; when you are forced to consume (1) \"SAN\" point, (2) \"overheating\" points accumulate."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你触及了【禁忌真相】！！！「SAN」- (1)"
msgstr "You have touched the [forbidden truth]! ! ! 「SAN」- (1)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你从其手牌抽(2)张牌"
msgstr "You draw (2) cards from his hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的「操作阶段」结束后"
msgstr "After your \"operation phase\" is over"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的「操作阶段」结束时"
msgstr "At the end of your \"operational phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的调查范围上限 = (N × 4)"
msgstr "The upper limit of your investigation scope = (N × 4)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的调查范围为(0)~(0)"
msgstr "The scope of your investigation is (0)~(0)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的调查范围为(0)~(0)；你不能恢复或主动消耗「SAN」；当被迫消耗(1)点「SAN」时，累计(2)点「过热」。"
msgstr "Your investigation range is (0)~(0); you cannot recover or actively consume \"SAN\"; when forced to consume (1) \"SAN\" point, (2) \"overheating\" points accumulate."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的每个技能，每个「操作阶段」可使用(1)次。"
msgstr "Each of your skills can be used (1) times per \"operation phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你的友方「调查员」开始「操作阶段」时，其「指挥者」可以从「情报弃牌区」选取(1)张「情报」卡牌，并从「策略卡组」抽(1)张「策略」卡牌，加入其手牌。"
msgstr "When your friendly \"Investigator\" starts the \"Operation Phase\", its \"Commander\" can select (1) \"Intelligence\" card from the \"Intelligence Discard Zone\" and draw (1) \"Strategy\" card from the \"Strategy Card Deck\" to add to his hand."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你调查到【禁忌真相】时，消耗的「SAN」+ (1)。"
msgstr "When you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], the \"SAN\" consumed + (1)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你调查到【禁忌真相】时，掷(1)个骰子；若点数为奇数：你「恢复清醒」并获得(1)点「SAN」；若点数为偶数：指定同队的(1)位「调查员」，视作其调查到【禁忌真相】。"
msgstr "When you investigate the [Forbidden Truth], roll (1) dice; if the number is an odd number: you \"recover\" and gain (1) \"SAN\" point; if the number is an even number: designate (1) \"Investigator\" of the same team, who is deemed to have investigated the [Forbidden Truth]."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你进行调查时，除非调查到【禁忌真相】，否则无需公示「情报」卡牌。"
msgstr "When you conduct an investigation, there is no need to reveal the \"Intelligence\" card unless you investigate the \"Forbidden Truth\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你可以知道很多，但不能承受一切。"
msgstr "You can know a lot, but you can't bear everything."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你立刻进行调查"
msgstr "You investigate immediately"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你每个「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Each of your \"operational stages\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你是「调查工会」的一名「指挥者」，能有这样的身份，说明你已经熬过了最困难的头几年，不仅活了下来，而且还神志清醒地坚持留在了这里。坐到这个位置，你已经不需要实地执行任务，你的工作就是为你的「调查员」在任务过程中下发「策略」指令，通过经验、直觉和智慧引领他们完成任务。"
msgstr "You are a \"commander\" of the \"Investigation Union\". Being able to have such an identity means that you have survived the most difficult first few years. Not only did you survive, but you also insisted on staying here with your mind clear. Sitting in this position, you no longer need to perform tasks on the spot. Your job is to issue \"strategic\" instructions to your \"investigators\" during the task, and lead them to complete the task through experience, intuition and wisdom."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你受到盲从效果"
msgstr "You are subject to the blind obedience effect"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你下一次调查受到胁迫 + (N)"
msgstr "Your next investigation is under duress + (N)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你与其立刻轮流进行不中断的调查"
msgstr "Instead of you immediately taking turns conducting an uninterrupted investigation"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你在「操作阶段」结束时"
msgstr "When you are at the end of the \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "你在当前的「操作阶段」无需且不能调查。跳过可以在操作阶段的任意节点生效，效果持续到该操作阶段结束。"
msgstr "You do not need to and cannot investigate during the current \"operation phase\". Skipping can take effect at any node in the operation phase, and the effect lasts until the end of the operation phase."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "凝视 · I"
msgstr "Gaze · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "判例"
msgstr "Jurisprudence"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "贫瘠之罪"
msgstr "Sin of Scarcity"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "平衡 · I"
msgstr "Balance · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "平衡 · II"
msgstr "Balance · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "平衡 · III"
msgstr "Balance · III"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "破釜沉舟 · I"
msgstr "Burn the Boats · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "破釜沉舟 · II"
msgstr "Burn the Boats · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "普奇耶拉"
msgstr "Puchiera"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其「调查员」（任选）"
msgstr "Its \"investigator\" (optional)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其「指挥者」需要将手牌放回"
msgstr "Its \"Commander\" needs to put the cards back into his hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其不能成为"
msgstr "it cannot be"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其调查到【禁忌真相】时"
msgstr "When he investigates the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其可以在任意(1)个「操作阶段」"
msgstr "It can be used in any (1) \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其他「调查员」使用「策略」卡牌时，你可以代为支付该卡牌的费用，然后掷(1)个骰子，随机决定该卡牌的指定对象。"
msgstr "When other \"Investigators\" use the \"Strategy\" card, you can pay the cost of the card on your behalf, and then roll (1) dice to randomly determine the designated target of the card."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其他队伍的所有「调查员」都「陷入疯狂」时，最后一只队伍及其「指挥者」获得游戏胜利。"
msgstr "When all the \"investigators\" of other teams \"go crazy\", the last team and its \"commander\" win the game."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其下(1)个「操作阶段」"
msgstr "The next (1) \"operation stage\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其下一次调查受到胁迫 + (N)"
msgstr "His next investigation is under duress + (N)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "其下一个「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Its next \"operational phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置(1)张对其布置的「个体机制」"
msgstr "Discard (1) \"Individual Mechanism\" assigned to it"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置(1)张手牌"
msgstr "Discard (1) hand card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置(2)张手牌"
msgstr "Discard (2) cards from hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置并重新翻牌"
msgstr "Discard and re-flop"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置场上所有已布置的"
msgstr "Discard all placed items on the discard field"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弃置所有「指挥者」的手牌"
msgstr "Discard all \"Commander\" cards from hand"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "乔 · 奇普"
msgstr "Joe Chip"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "清醒"
msgstr "wide awake"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "清醒技能"
msgstr "Awake Ability"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报"
msgstr "Intelligence"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报 · I"
msgstr "Intelligence · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报 · II"
msgstr "Intelligence · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报 · III"
msgstr "Intelligence · III"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报 · IV"
msgstr "Intelligence · IV"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报卡组"
msgstr "Intelligence deck"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报区"
msgstr "intelligence area"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "情报区应当保持公示；禁忌真相是这一轮的警示线。"
msgstr "Intelligence areas should remain public; taboo truth is the warning line this round."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "全部"
msgstr "All"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "全能侦探"
msgstr "Omniscient Detective"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "确定「指挥者」人数"
msgstr "Determine the number of \"commanders\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "确认完成以上步骤后，你们可以参照下图“场地布置”，设置你们的桌面（以6位玩家，分属2个队伍为例），或选择适合你们的布局。"
msgstr "After confirming that the above steps are completed, you can refer to the \"site layout\" in the picture below to set up your desktop (taking 6 players belonging to 2 teams as an example), or choose a layout that suits you."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "群体思维"
msgstr "Groupthink"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "然后私下对窥探的「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Then privately review the spying \"Intelligence\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "然后指定另(1)位「调查员」"
msgstr "Then designate another (1) \"Investigator\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "让别人的调查先结束。"
msgstr "Let other people's investigations end first."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "任何「策略」卡牌的指定对象"
msgstr "The target of any \"Strategy\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "任务负债 · 赏金猎人"
msgstr "Mission Debt · Bounty Hunter"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "任务简报"
msgstr "mission briefing"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "任意「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时，本「轮」游戏结束。该「调查员」的「SAN」将相应减少（无特殊效果时，减少(1)点「SAN」）。"
msgstr "When any \"Investigator\" investigates the \"Forbidden Truth\", this \"round\" game ends. The \"SAN\" of this \"Investigator\" will be reduced accordingly (when there is no special effect, (1) \"SAN\" point will be reduced)."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "任意「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】时，本「轮」游戏结束。该「调查员」的「SAN」将相应减少（无特殊效果时，减少(1)点「SAN」）。收回场上所有的「情报」卡牌，洗切组成新的「情报卡组」。"
msgstr "When any \"Investigator\" investigates the \"Forbidden Truth\", this \"round\" game ends. The \"SAN\" of this \"Investigator\" will be reduced accordingly (when there is no special effect, (1) \"SAN\" point will be reduced). Collect all \"Intelligence\" cards on the field and shuffle them to form a new \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "日本語"
msgstr "Japanese"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如果翻出涉及超过(1)个对象的卡牌"
msgstr "If a card involving more than (1) object is revealed"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如果通过任何手段洗回【禁忌真相】，计数不上升；若计数已经达到阈值，则下一个调查到【禁忌真相】的调查员消耗 SAN。"
msgstr "If the [Forbidden Truth] is washed back by any means, the count will not increase; if the count has reached the threshold, the next investigator who investigates the [Forbidden Truth] will consume SAN."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如果玩家通过任何手段洗回【禁忌真相】，降雨概率的计数不上升；如果计数已经达到阈值，则下一个调查到禁忌真相的「调查员」消耗「SAN」。"
msgstr "If the player recovers the [Forbidden Truth] by any means, the rain probability count will not increase; if the count has reached the threshold, the next \"Investigator\" who investigates the Forbidden Truth will consume \"SAN\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如果玩家通过任何手段洗回【禁忌真相】（例如使用【直视神】），降雨概率的计数不上升。如果计数已经达到 (N)，则下一个调查到禁忌真相的调查员消耗 SAN。"
msgstr "If the player regains [Forbidden Truth] by any means (such as using [Looking Directly at God]), the rain probability count will not increase. If the count has reached (N), the next investigator who discovers the forbidden truth consumes SAN."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如果有超过(2)个队伍在场"
msgstr "If there are more than (2) teams present"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "如无特殊说明，「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」无法成为卡牌的指定对象、也不受卡牌或技能的效果影响。"
msgstr "Unless otherwise specified, the \"Investigator\" who \"falls into madness\" cannot be the designated target of the card, and is not affected by the effects of cards or skills."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若「调查员」在「操作阶段」"
msgstr "If the \"Investigator\" is in the \"Operation Phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若「指挥者」在调查到【禁忌真相】时主动公示，则不触发此技能。"
msgstr "If the \"Commander\" proactively announces the [Forbidden Truth] when investigating it, this skill will not be triggered."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若【禁忌真相】在被弃置的卡牌中"
msgstr "If [Forbidden Truth] is among the discarded cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若本「轮」已经触发【命定之人】"
msgstr "If this \"Wheel\" has been triggered [Destined Person]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若出现一个操作导致所有剩余「调查员」都「陷入疯狂」的情况，最后「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」及其所在队伍获得游戏胜利。"
msgstr "If an operation causes all remaining \"investigators\" to \"go crazy\", the last \"investigator\" who \"goes crazy\" and his team will win the game."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若你「陷入疯狂」，你可以将手牌给(1)名「指挥者」。"
msgstr "If you \"go crazy\", you can give cards in your hand to (1) \"Commander\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若你调查到【禁忌真相】"
msgstr "If you investigate the [Forbidden Truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若你在当前「操作阶段」未进行调查"
msgstr "If you have not conducted an investigation in the current \"operation stage\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若其调查到【禁忌真相】"
msgstr "If he investigates the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若其调查到【禁忌真相】时"
msgstr "If he investigates the [forbidden truth]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若同时使用多张【窥探 · I】"
msgstr "If you use multiple pictures at the same time [Peeping · I]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若同时使用多张【窥探 · II】"
msgstr "If you use multiple pictures at the same time [Peeping · II]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若同时使用多张【窥探 · III】"
msgstr "If multiple images are used at the same time [Peeping · III]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若同时使用多张【窥探 · IV】"
msgstr "If you use multiple [Peeping · IV] at the same time"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若无人质疑，在「操作阶段」结束时，将【禁忌真相】洗回「情报卡组」。"
msgstr "If no one questions it, at the end of the \"Operation Phase\", shuffle [Forbidden Truth] back to the \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若有≥3张【任务负债】对你布置"
msgstr "If there are ≥3 [Task Liabilities] assigned to you"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "弱肉强食"
msgstr "Survival of the Fittest"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "三段式行动，顺序很重要。"
msgstr "Three-stage action, the order is very important."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "深潜"
msgstr "Deep Dive"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "深入"
msgstr "go deep"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "生效后弃置"
msgstr "Discard after taking effect"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "圣诞节"
msgstr "Christmas"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "胜负判定"
msgstr "Determination of victory or defeat"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "盛宴"
msgstr "Feast"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "剩余的「情报卡组」"
msgstr "The remaining \"Information Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使其「恢复清醒」"
msgstr "to \"recover\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使其消耗(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "Make it consume (1) \"SAN\" point"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使其增加(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "Add (1) \"SAN\" point to it"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使用「调查员」的技能，如无特殊说明，可以不限次数使用任意技能。"
msgstr "Use the skills of \"Investigator\". Unless otherwise specified, you can use any skill an unlimited number of times."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使用「情报区」的「情报」卡牌，执行其卡面效果。该行动可以不限次数自由执行。"
msgstr "Use the \"Intelligence\" card in the \"Information Area\" to perform its card effect. This action can be performed freely as many times as you like."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使用的前(2)张「策略」消耗为(0)"
msgstr "The first (2) \"Strategy\" cards used cost (0)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "使用自己手牌中的「策略」卡牌（通常需要消耗「情报区」的「情报」卡牌），该行动可以不限次数自由执行。"
msgstr "Using the \"Strategy\" cards in your hand (usually requiring the consumption of \"Intelligence\" cards from the \"Intelligence Area\"), this action can be performed freely as many times as you like."

