msgstr "Description updated version: v1.0"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "私下（队内）查看指定数量的情报牌后原样放回。"
msgstr "Check the specified number of intelligence cards privately (within the team) and put them back as they are."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "私下（队内）顺序查看 (N) 张「情报」卡牌，并将其原样放回。没有特殊描述时，默认从情报卡组顶部向下执行。"
msgstr "Privately (within the team) check (N) \"Intelligence\" cards in order and put them back as they are. If there is no special description, it will be executed from the top of the intelligence deck downwards by default."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "私下（队内）顺序查看指定数量的「情报」卡牌，再将其原样放回。没有特殊描述时，默认从「情报卡组」顶部向下执行。"
msgstr "Check the designated number of \"Intelligence\" cards in order privately (within the team), and then put them back as they are. If there is no special description, it will be executed from the top of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\" by default."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "私下对其调整"
msgstr "Adjust it privately"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "私下放入「情报卡组」的任意位置"
msgstr "Privately put it anywhere in the \"Information Card Deck\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "四个页面，"
msgstr "four pages,"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "四类卡组"
msgstr "Four types of card groups"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "四类卡组，一张真相。"
msgstr "Four types of card decks, one piece of truth."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "搜索调查员、策略、环境、情报与辅助卡牌。"
msgstr "Search for investigators, strategy, environment, intelligence and support cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "搜索规则关键词"
msgstr "Search rule keywords"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "搜索与筛选"
msgstr "Search and Filter"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「策略」卡牌的消耗 - (N)，(N) = 已「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」数量 ÷ (2)，向下取整。"
msgstr "The cost of all \"Strategy\" cards - (N), (N) = the number of \"Investigators\" who have \"gone crazy\" ÷ (2), rounded down."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「调查员」的「调查范围」 + (1)"
msgstr "\"Investigation Scope\" of all \"Investigators\" + (1)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「调查员」调查的范围 + (1)"
msgstr "Scope of investigation by all \"Investigators\" + (1)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「调查员」可以自由使用"
msgstr "All \"Investigators\" can use it freely"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「调查员」可以自由选择从「情报卡组」最上或最下进行正向或反向调查。"
msgstr "All \"Investigators\" can freely choose to conduct forward or reverse investigations from the top or bottom of the \"Intelligence Card Deck\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「调查员」受到胁迫 + (2)"
msgstr "All \"Investigators\" are under duress + (2)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「指挥者」公示手牌"
msgstr "All “Commanders” reveal their hands"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「指挥者」立即按「调查顺位」"
msgstr "All \"Commanders\" immediately click \"Investigation Order\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「指挥者」轮流抽回(1)张手牌"
msgstr "All \"Commanders\" take turns to draw (1) cards from their hands"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「指挥者」需轮流给出(1)张手牌"
msgstr "All \"Commanders\" need to take turns to give (1) hand cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有「SAN」不满的清醒「调查员」"
msgstr "The sober \"investigator\" who dissatisfied all \"SAN\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有队伍的「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "\"Information\" cards for all teams"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "所有卡牌， 一览无遗。"
msgstr "All Cards, at a Glance."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "它可以在即时行动打出并指定你时、个体机制打出并对你布置时、个体机制满足条件触发时，以及个体机制持续对你生效时触发。不必在【俄罗斯转轮 · I】首次生效的瞬间触发照亮前路。"
msgstr "It can be triggered when an instant action is played and targets you, when an individual mechanism is played and deployed to you, when the individual mechanism meets the conditions to trigger, and when the individual mechanism continues to be effective on you. It is not necessary to trigger Illuminating the Way when [Russian Wheel · I] first takes effect."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "它可以在以下情况下生效：即时行动打出并指定你时；个体机制打出并对你布置时；个体机制满足条件触发时（如【盲从 · I】）；个体机制持续对你生效时（如【俄罗斯转轮 · I】）。不必在俄罗斯转轮首次生效的瞬间触发照亮前路。"
msgstr "It can take effect under the following circumstances: when an instant action is played and assigned to you; when an individual mechanism is played and assigned to you; when an individual mechanism meets the conditions to be triggered (such as [Blind Obedience·I]); when an individual mechanism continues to take effect on you (such as [Russian Wheel·I]). Light the way doesn't have to be triggered the moment Russian Wheel first takes effect."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊文本标识"
msgstr "Special Text Identifier"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊文本标识、行动词典，以及版本边界都集中在这里。它是规则书的判例层，也是查牌时最快的入口。"
msgstr "Special text identifiers, action dictionaries, and version boundaries are concentrated here. It is the precedent layer of the rule book and the fastest entry point when checking cards."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊行动"
msgstr "Special Operations"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊行动词典 →"
msgstr "Special Actions Glossary →"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊行动词典。"
msgstr "Special Actions Glossary."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "特殊行动列表"
msgstr "Special Operations List"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "提供的费用 + (N)"
msgstr "Cost provided + (N)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "条资料命中"
msgstr "data hits"

