msgid "跳过"
msgstr "Skip"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "跳过 · I"
msgstr "Skip · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "跳过 · II"
msgstr "Skip · II"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "跳过：你在当前的「操作阶段」"
msgstr "Skip: You are in the current \"operation phase\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "通过任意手段恢复「SAN」的疯狂「调查员」会「恢复清醒」；没有「SAN」的特殊「调查员」不能用这种方式恢复清醒。"
msgstr "Crazy \"Investigators\" who restore \"SAN\" by any means will \"recover\"; special \"Investigators\" who do not have \"SAN\" cannot regain consciousness in this way."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "统一行动词典、文本标识与版本边界。"
msgstr "Unified Action Dictionary, Text Identification and Version Boundaries."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "偷天换日 · I"
msgstr "Switcheroo · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "投掷的骰子数量累加"
msgstr "The number of dice rolled adds up"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "骰子记录 SAN，卡牌按类型分区。"
msgstr "Dice record SANs, and cards are partitioned by type."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "玩家人数"
msgstr "Number of players"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "维姬 · 雪莱"
msgstr "Vicki Shelley"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "问你想问的，"
msgstr "Ask what you want to ask,"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "无法被弃置"
msgstr "cannot be discarded"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "无法给出手牌的「指挥者」也无法抽牌"
msgstr "The \"Commander\" who cannot give out the cards in his hand cannot draw cards either."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "无法指定「SAN」≤ (1)的「调查员」"
msgstr "Unable to specify \"Investigator\" for \"SAN\" ≤ (1)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "无需且不能调查"
msgstr "No need and cannot be investigated"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "五个类别，一套可搜索的规则资料索引。"
msgstr "Five categories, a searchable index of rules data."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "兀自沉沦"
msgstr "Sinking Alone"

