msgid "胁迫 · I"
msgstr "Coercion · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "胁迫：调查的「情报」卡牌 + (N)"
msgstr "Coercion: Investigation \"Intelligence\" card + (N)"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "斜体加粗的词表示特殊行动；普通文本中出现同名词汇，不自动获得特殊行动含义。"
msgstr "Words in italics and bold indicate special actions; words with the same name appearing in ordinary text do not automatically acquire special action meanings."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "斜体加粗的词才指代特殊行动。普通文本中出现同名词汇，不自动获得特殊行动含义。"
msgstr "Words in italics and bold refer to special operations. Words with the same name appearing in ordinary text do not automatically acquire special action meanings."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "新一「轮」游戏开始"
msgstr "A new \"round\" game begins"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "新增或修改资料后运行 npm run generate:wiki；部署构建会自动运行同一流程。"
msgstr "After adding or modifying information, run npm run generate:wiki; the deployment build will automatically run the same process."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "信仰 · I"
msgstr "Faith · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "行动词典"
msgstr "Mobile Dictionary"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "虚假信仰 · I"
msgstr "False Belief · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "许愿池"
msgstr "Wishing Well"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "选取(1)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Select (1) \"Intelligence\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "选择一个问题，或者输入你想确认的规则。"
msgstr "Select a question or enter the rule you want to confirm."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "选择语言"
msgstr "Select language"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "一个人的笼中鸟"
msgstr "A Lone Caged Bird"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "一款支持 2–6 人游玩的非直接对战美式桌游。你将扮演“指挥者”，操控调查员，在调查中规避禁忌真相，并诱导对手比你更早陷入疯狂。"
msgstr "An indirect combat American board game that supports 2–6 players. You will play the role of the \"commander\", controlling the investigators, evading taboo truths during the investigation, and inducing your opponents to fall into madness earlier than you do."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "一轮游戏"
msgstr "round game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "移除所有临时「SAN」"
msgstr "Remove all temporary \"SANs\""

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "已「陷入疯狂」的「调查员」参与游戏"
msgstr "An \"Investigator\" who has \"gone crazy\" joins the game"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "已归档判例"
msgstr "Archived cases"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "已找到相关资料，请查看上方命中结果。"
msgstr "Relevant information has been found, please check the hit results above."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "异时癖 · I"
msgstr "Chronophilia · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "因为这些卡牌的效果需要涉及 (2) 位调查员；许愿池无法满足这个调用条件。"
msgstr "Because these cards' effects require (2) investigators to be involved; the wishing well cannot satisfy this call condition."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "阴阳魔界"
msgstr "The Twilight Zone"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "印刷相关"
msgstr "Printing related"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "优先查阅最新版规则指引书、调查附录与 FAQ；实体卡牌的印刷问题以已公开的勘误为准。"
msgstr "Prioritize access to the latest version of the rule guide, survey appendix and FAQ; for printing issues on physical cards, please refer to the published errata."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "优先查阅最新版规则指引书、调查附录与 FAQ。实体卡牌的印刷问题以已公开的勘误为准。"
msgstr "Prioritize access to the latest version of the Rules Guide, Survey Addendum and FAQ. Printing issues on physical cards are subject to published errata."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "优先查阅最新版规则指引书、调查附录与判例；实体卡牌的印刷问题以已公开的勘误为准。"
msgstr "Prioritize access to the latest version of the rules guide, survey appendix, and precedents; for printing issues on physical cards, please refer to the published errata."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "由「调查员」的【疯狂蔓延】技能带来的「辅助」卡牌，依旧可以受到其他「策略」卡牌的影响，但需要检查其卡面文本。"
msgstr "The \"auxiliary\" cards brought by the \"Investigator\"'s [Crazy Spread] skill can still be affected by other \"strategy\" cards, but their card text needs to be checked."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "由累计最多费用的「调查员」"
msgstr "The \"investigator\" who has accumulated the most expenses"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "由你指定每「轮」内每种【窥探】卡牌可以窥探的「情报」卡牌数量 ，范围为(1) ~ (6)。需要在每种【窥探】卡牌第一次被使用时进行指定，指定的数量在每「轮」内不能变更。"
msgstr "You designate the number of \"Intelligence\" cards that each \"Prying\" card can spy on in each \"round\", ranging from (1) ~ (6). Each [Spying] card needs to be designated when it is used for the first time, and the designated number cannot be changed within each \"round\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "由消耗「情报」卡牌的「指挥者」决定"
msgstr "Determined by the \"Commander\" who consumes the \"Intelligence\" card"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "游戏机制"
msgstr "game mechanics"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "游戏配件"
msgstr "gaming accessories"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "游戏支持 2—6 名玩家；同一队伍的「指挥者」共享公开的「情报」信息，但只能指挥自己的「调查员」。"
msgstr "The game supports 2-6 players; \"commanders\" of the same team share public \"intelligence\" information, but can only command their own \"investigators\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "游戏支持几个人？"
msgstr "How many people does the game support?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "游戏准备"
msgstr "game preparation"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "与同桌讨论并达成共识后继续游戏；如果该问题反复出现，建议反馈给制作团队，纳入后续规则更新。"
msgstr "Continue the game after discussing with your tablemates and reaching a consensus; if this problem occurs repeatedly, it is recommended to provide feedback to the production team and include it in subsequent rule updates."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "欲加之罪"
msgstr "Manufactured Guilt"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "遇到边界情况，先看这里。"
msgstr "If you encounter a borderline situation, look here first."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "原则上，同一队伍的信息共享仅限于窥探的信息，队友间不可互相检视手牌，沟通信息需公开对话。但玩家们可以按照实际游戏情况，选择合适的信息共享规则。"
msgstr "In principle, information sharing within the same team is limited to snooped information. Teammates are not allowed to check each other's hands, and communication requires open dialogue. However, players can choose appropriate information sharing rules according to the actual game situation."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "圆滑 · I"
msgstr "Smooth Operator · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "再次与其交换"
msgstr "exchange it again"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "再指定(1)位「调查员」消耗(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "Designating (1) more \"Investigators\" consumes (1) \"SAN\" points"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "在《调查 : 深入》的游戏中，每名玩家扮演一位「指挥者」，指挥「调查员」对「情报卡组」进行调查，尝试了解【禁忌真相】在「情报卡组」中的位置，让自己的「调查员」规避它，并让其他队伍的「调查员」调查到【禁忌真相】。"
msgstr "In the game \"Investigation: In-Depth\", each player plays a \"Commander\", directing the \"Investigators\" to investigate the \"Intelligence Card Deck\", trying to understand the position of the \"Forbidden Truth\" in the \"Intelligence Card Deck\", allowing his or her \"Investigators\" to avoid it, and allowing the \"Investigators\" of other teams to investigate the \"Forbidden Truth\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "则不消耗而是恢复(1)点「SAN」"
msgstr "It will not consume but restore (1) \"SAN\" point."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "怎样获胜？"
msgstr "How to win?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "张卡牌"
msgstr "Cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "张数向下取整"
msgstr "Number of sheets rounded down"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "照亮前路 · I"
msgstr "Light the Way · I"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "这里保留创作资料入口，内容待补充。"
msgstr "The entrance to creative materials is reserved here, and the content will be added."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "这里记录已经明确的机制判例、环境卡牌边界与印刷勘误。FAQ 是对规则正文的补充，不会取代最新版规则指引书。"
msgstr "This is where clear mechanical precedents, environment card boundaries, and typographical errata are recorded. The FAQ is a supplement to the main text of the rules and will not replace the latest version of the Rules Guide."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "这里是网站规则与卡牌资料的内容源。以后优先修改 Markdown；CSV 只保存适合筛选、统计和排序的结构化字段。"
msgstr "This is the content source for the site's rules and card information. In the future, Markdown will be modified first; CSV only saves structured fields suitable for filtering, statistics and sorting."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "这里收录《调查深入》的全部卡牌。你可以按类别、版本、费用和效果查找；展开卡片即可查看完整文本，说明更新版本也一并标注。"
msgstr "All the cards in \"Investigation\" are included here. You can search by category, version, cost and performance; expand the card to see the full text, with instructions for newer versions also noted."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "正面朝上放置"
msgstr "Place face up"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "正向窥探(2)张「情报」卡牌"
msgstr "Forward Peeping (2) \"Intelligence\" cards"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "正在查阅规则指引书和卡牌资料……"
msgstr "Checking the rules guide and card information..."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "支持几个人？"
msgstr "How many people do you support?"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "支付【胁迫】的费用"
msgstr "Pay the cost of [coercion]"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "执行(2)次调查"
msgstr "Conducted (2) surveys"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "执行一次跳过"
msgstr "perform a skip"

