msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "每位「指挥者」会被派发(2 × N)张候选的「调查员」卡牌，从中选取指挥(N)位「调查员」，建议以如下配比进行游戏："
msgstr "Each \"Commander\" is dealt (2 × N) candidate \"Investigator\" cards and selects (N) \"Investigators\" to command. We recommend the following player ratios:"

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "玩家也可以其他配比开始游戏，场上开局时调查员数量需≥4。"
msgstr "Other player ratios may be used, but at least (4) Investigators must be in play at setup."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "将参与本局游戏的「调查员指示卡」洗切，随机布置到场上的「顺位指示卡」边。"
msgstr "Shuffle the \"Investigator Tokens\" used in this game and place them randomly beside the \"Order Tokens\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "卡牌右上角的骰子点数，标识该「调查员」的「SAN」上限。"
msgstr "The die value in the upper-right corner of a card indicates that \"Investigator's\" maximum \"SAN\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "判定「环境」、已经对「调查员」布置的「个体机制」或「调查员」技能，是否有可以/必须触发生效的，如有，触发卡牌或技能。"
msgstr "Check the \"Environment\", any \"Deferred Strategies\" assigned to the \"Investigator\", and the \"Investigator's\" abilities; resolve anything that may or must trigger."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "对「情报卡组」进行调查（从「情报卡组」顶部，顺序翻看并公示(1)~(3)张「情报」卡牌，然后纳入自己的「情报区」）。如无特殊描述，每位「调查员」每个「操作阶段」必须、且只能执行一次调查。"
msgstr "Investigate the \"Intelligence Deck\" (reveal and announce (1)–(3) \"Intelligence\" cards in order from the top, then add them to your \"Intelligence Area\"). Unless stated otherwise, each \"Investigator\" must investigate exactly once during each \"Operation Phase\"."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "判定「环境」卡牌、已经对「调查员」布置的「个体机制」，或「调查员」技能是否有可以/必须触发生效的，如有，触发卡牌或技能。"
msgstr "Check the \"Environment\" card, any \"Deferred Strategies\" assigned to the \"Investigator\", and the \"Investigator's\" abilities; resolve anything that may or must trigger."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "若「调查员」因此导致「SAN」归零，其将会「陷入疯狂」。将其「调查员」卡牌与「调查员指示卡」翻面，所有对其布置的「个体机制」被弃置。"
msgstr "If an \"Investigator's\" \"SAN\" reaches zero as a result, they \"Go Mad\". Flip their \"Investigator\" card and \"Investigator Token\", then discard every \"Deferred Strategy\" assigned to them."

msgctxt "fragment"
msgid "一份会继续生长的规则书。"
msgstr "A Rulebook That Keeps Growing."
